(6486357, 962862, 136201, '<td valign="top">This is nice. With a few small tweaks, I think it would be *very* nice. The horizon feels slightly crooked, like it''s rotated a hair clockwise. It might be due to the weight and position of the castle and the trees on either side. Also, the cropping seems a little off. The castle needs to be either more in the center, or more off-center - to my eye it looks to be in a slightly awkward spot. But the lighting and overall feel is great!</td>', 'This is nice. With a few small tweaks, I think it would be *very* nice. The horizon feels slightly crooked, like it''s rotated a hair clockwise. It might be due to the weight and position of the castle and the trees on either side. Also, the cropping seems a little off. The castle needs to be either more in the center, or more off-center - to my eye it looks to be in a slightly awkward spot. But the lighting and overall feel is great!', '2011-08-01 01:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
