(6486532, 964766, 108580, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setting. The lone trees and deep red African sun. It''s on my bucket list. Africa is in our blood. You lucky fish. Where where the ellies?</td>', 'Beautiful setting. The lone trees and deep red African sun. It''s on my bucket list. Africa is in our blood. You lucky fish. Where where the ellies?', '2011-08-01 04:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
