(6487707, 964444, 30669, '<td valign="top">Very Interesting. When I was 11 years old in 1960, I stayed there with my family and it was known then as the Ukrainian  Hotel.At the time we were among the few Americans visiting Moscow as it was when the U 2 was shot down over the USSR. <br/>Your photo has an old post card look to it. VERY NICE!<br/>10</td>', 'Very Interesting. When I was 11 years old in 1960, I stayed there with my family and it was known then as the Ukrainian  Hotel.At the time we were among the few Americans visiting Moscow as it was when the U 2 was shot down over the USSR. Your photo has an old post card look to it. VERY NICE!10', '2011-08-01 21:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487714, 962013, 117474, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to have seem more of the mist from the waves. But still, very dramatic capture. Nice.</td>', 'Would have liked to have seem more of the mist from the waves. But still, very dramatic capture. Nice.', '2011-08-01 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
