(6487723, 964839, 113411, '<td valign="top">Fabulous! I love everything about this...color, composition, textures. I''d love to blow it up<br/>and hang it on a wall! 10</td>', 'Fabulous! I love everything about this...color, composition, textures. I''d love to blow it upand hang it on a wall! 10', '2011-08-01 21:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
