(6487725, 964880, 117474, '<td valign="top">This made me laugh! There''s so much motion in this that I feel dizzy just looking at it! Great capture. Really.</td>', 'This made me laugh! There''s so much motion in this that I feel dizzy just looking at it! Great capture. Really.', '2011-08-01 21:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487729, 964306, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent detail.</td>', 'Excellent detail.', '2011-08-01 21:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487732, 964182, 117474, '<td valign="top">The glare makes this shot! The shadows. The viewpoints. The sepia (even looked at my sepia chart!) Really nice image. Lots going on. But it all tells a story. Great work! <br/> <br/>I don''t have a sepia chart.</td>', 'The glare makes this shot! The shadows. The viewpoints. The sepia (even looked at my sepia chart!) Really nice image. Lots going on. But it all tells a story. Great work!  I don''t have a sepia chart.', '2011-08-01 21:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
