(6487839, 961102, 16106, '<td valign="top">My favorite of the challenge. I wish the frame was squared up and the pitchfork was all in the frame, but the critters, the colors,the expression of the model, the lighting, is all spot on.</td>', 'My favorite of the challenge. I wish the frame was squared up and the pitchfork was all in the frame, but the critters, the colors,the expression of the model, the lighting, is all spot on.', '2011-08-01 23:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487847, 963263, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not totally in love or anything, but ... well, I do like it - this could just be really nice on a wall.  Good POV, and eclectic subject matter.</td>', 'Not totally in love or anything, but ... well, I do like it - this could just be really nice on a wall.  Good POV, and eclectic subject matter.', '2011-08-01 23:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487854, 964306, 112828, '<td valign="top">A very nice street portrait..  I''m always torn by the cropping on these, it seems that the in vogue thing is to really fill the frame.. I guess it does work, but there''s something about not seeing the top of her hat and her not having just a bit more space in front of her face, that just... Dunno, just kinda makes me wonder if I''d like it more with a looser crop...  Still - great image, I''m hoping you''ve posted a story with this one.</td>', 'A very nice street portrait..  I''m always torn by the cropping on these, it seems that the in vogue thing is to really fill the frame.. I guess it does work, but there''s something about not seeing the top of her hat and her not having just a bit more space in front of her face, that just... Dunno, just kinda makes me wonder if I''d like it more with a looser crop...  Still - great image, I''m hoping you''ve posted a story with this one.', '2011-08-01 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487860, 964622, 112828, '<td valign="top">funny..  And kinda just kinda strange...  So, the question that''s burning in my mind is -6 who''s the person standing behind you in the blue shirt?</td>', 'funny..  And kinda just kinda strange...  So, the question that''s burning in my mind is -6 who''s the person standing behind you in the blue shirt?', '2011-08-01 23:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487862, 964429, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nice BIF... I don''t see a band either, so I''m guessing this is a wild specimen?  Well done in either case, quite excellent if this is a wild bird.</td>', 'Nice BIF... I don''t see a band either, so I''m guessing this is a wild specimen?  Well done in either case, quite excellent if this is a wild bird.', '2011-08-01 23:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487863, 964740, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful, makes you wonder what they are saying to each other.</td>', 'This is wonderful, makes you wonder what they are saying to each other.', '2011-08-01 23:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487865, 964872, 121949, '<td valign="top">Nice tones I especially like the candycane stiped stacks.</td>', 'Nice tones I especially like the candycane stiped stacks.', '2011-08-01 23:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487866, 963031, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft pastels that would have done great in the pastel challenge. The way the dark trees on the left balances out the long flow of the far shore is perfect. The decision to put the main line on the upper third works really well. 8</td>', 'Lovely soft pastels that would have done great in the pastel challenge. The way the dark trees on the left balances out the long flow of the far shore is perfect. The decision to put the main line on the upper third works really well. 8', '2011-08-01 23:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487869, 964511, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very much my kind of shot!  Bikes, chopped heads, a great day to ride, wide angle... all good!  All very good!  Will undoubtedly be one of my favorites of the challenge, and is the first one I''m voting on.  Picked it special!</td>', 'Very much my kind of shot!  Bikes, chopped heads, a great day to ride, wide angle... all good!  All very good!  Will undoubtedly be one of my favorites of the challenge, and is the first one I''m voting on.  Picked it special!', '2011-08-01 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487870, 962253, 121949, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, could use a bit more sharpness, and it''s a bit dark but it could just be my screen. I like how the red stands out against the blue.</td>', 'Beautiful scene, could use a bit more sharpness, and it''s a bit dark but it could just be my screen. I like how the red stands out against the blue.', '2011-08-01 23:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487871, 964879, 25787, '<td valign="top">A striking shot!</td>', 'A striking shot!', '2011-08-01 23:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487872, 964454, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful use of that gentle foreground.  I also like that peek of the stream meandering down.  Beautifully composed and good processing - not overdone - very real.  Overall very peaceful - and it smells good, too.</td>', 'What a beautiful use of that gentle foreground.  I also like that peek of the stream meandering down.  Beautifully composed and good processing - not overdone - very real.  Overall very peaceful - and it smells good, too.', '2011-08-01 23:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487873, 964363, 121949, '<td valign="top">This is just lovely, I really love the pastel colors in the sky and then reflected into the water.</td>', 'This is just lovely, I really love the pastel colors in the sky and then reflected into the water.', '2011-08-01 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487875, 964847, 16106, '<td valign="top">The balance of the rough texture of the asphalt balanced against the glossy smoothness of the crawly really works well. 8</td>', 'The balance of the rough texture of the asphalt balanced against the glossy smoothness of the crawly really works well. 8', '2011-08-01 23:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487876, 963532, 30982, '<td valign="top">That tree branch is awesome.  Not as old as the structure, but it has been there awhile.  I''m not sold on the selective desaturation but then it has never been my thing.  I do think you have a strong, solid composition here, though some might declare it "busy".</td>', 'That tree branch is awesome.  Not as old as the structure, but it has been there awhile.  I''m not sold on the selective desaturation but then it has never been my thing.  I do think you have a strong, solid composition here, though some might declare it "busy".', '2011-08-01 23:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487881, 962264, 25787, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl. Skin seems a bit over processed, has a plastic like appearance.  Also I would like to see more of what she is holding (a guitar?) to complete the story about her. 6</td>', 'Pretty girl. Skin seems a bit over processed, has a plastic like appearance.  Also I would like to see more of what she is holding (a guitar?) to complete the story about her. 6', '2011-08-01 23:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487882, 962859, 30982, '<td valign="top">At first glance it almost appears as a toy until you see the gloved hand.  Then the spray. They you figure it probably is the real thing!  And even though he''s probably moving at a good clip (heh!) the framing makes the shot feel a bit static.  Still, a good job of isolating the car and driver from the background.</td>', 'At first glance it almost appears as a toy until you see the gloved hand.  Then the spray. They you figure it probably is the real thing!  And even though he''s probably moving at a good clip (heh!) the framing makes the shot feel a bit static.  Still, a good job of isolating the car and driver from the background.', '2011-08-01 23:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487884, 960715, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely picture postcard view - nice even hand with the processing so it isn''t overdone.  Love the reflected greens in the water!</td>', 'A lovely picture postcard view - nice even hand with the processing so it isn''t overdone.  Love the reflected greens in the water!', '2011-08-01 23:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487886, 964880, 25787, '<td valign="top">What a great pan shot!</td>', 'What a great pan shot!', '2011-08-01 23:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487888, 964756, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a warmth of summer feel - nice breeze, touch of humidity, too.  There''s a sort of pebbled look to the foreground and trees that may not appeal to some, but it gives it a different feel and contrasts against the very smooth sky - interesting!</td>', 'Has a warmth of summer feel - nice breeze, touch of humidity, too.  There''s a sort of pebbled look to the foreground and trees that may not appeal to some, but it gives it a different feel and contrasts against the very smooth sky - interesting!', '2011-08-01 23:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487889, 964548, 112828, '<td valign="top">Not quite what it wants to be - the color and general beauty of the bird is almost great, but not quite.  The crop is a bit off (too high or too low, you choose), and the image just doesn''t quite "pop", partially because the bird is standing in front of a light colored background, which is unevenly lit (dark would have been much better!)...  The eye could have been dodged a bit too I think, that would have added a bit of impact (maybe even a bit of saturation too, give it some nice yellow in the bottom part)..  The other thing about the image is that it seems just a little soft - especially towards the edges, not quite blurry enough to be bokeh, just not sharp...  You could have accented that with a bit of selective blurring..  *shrug* nothing personal at all of course, just making a few suggestions that may have helped the image.  (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1092225&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">made me do it</a>...)</td>', 'Not quite what it wants to be - the color and general beauty of the bird is almost great, but not quite.  The crop is a bit off (too high or too low, you choose), and the image just doesn''t quite "pop", partially because the bird is standing in front of a light colored background, which is unevenly lit (dark would have been much better!)...  The eye could have been dodged a bit too I think, that would have added a bit of impact (maybe even a bit of saturation too, give it some nice yellow in the bottom part)..  The other thing about the image is that it seems just a little soft - especially towards the edges, not quite blurry enough to be bokeh, just not sharp...  You could have accented that with a bit of selective blurring..  *shrug* nothing personal at all of course, just making a few suggestions that may have helped the image.  ( Melethia made me do it...)', '2011-08-01 23:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487892, 961943, 30982, '<td valign="top">That is a gorgeous cake!  Someone was probably very pleased.  Nice work with the exposure though perhaps a touch more light  from other than the candles to illuminate the arms would be good.  Still, the longer you look at it, the more it fits the mood.  I''d love a slice, thanks!</td>', 'That is a gorgeous cake!  Someone was probably very pleased.  Nice work with the exposure though perhaps a touch more light  from other than the candles to illuminate the arms would be good.  Still, the longer you look at it, the more it fits the mood.  I''d love a slice, thanks!', '2011-08-01 23:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487893, 964416, 30982, '<td valign="top">Aww, how sweet!  I love the shallow DOF used to isolate your subjects, and that you got both eyes with wee little catchlights.  So cute!</td>', 'Aww, how sweet!  I love the shallow DOF used to isolate your subjects, and that you got both eyes with wee little catchlights.  So cute!', '2011-08-01 23:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487894, 963977, 108544, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. Seems you had everything come together. There is nothing better, than a shot like this.<br/>The chance of the boat being red. The gull flying overhead. Then the comp, light , depth of field and exposure of the shot. Yeah, great job for sure!</td>', 'I really like this image. Seems you had everything come together. There is nothing better, than a shot like this.The chance of the boat being red. The gull flying overhead. Then the comp, light , depth of field and exposure of the shot. Yeah, great job for sure!', '2011-08-01 23:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487895, 964965, 30982, '<td valign="top">The angle and the position of the actors creates a marvelous sense of energy to this!  Nice work for what is probably difficult lighting.  The recovery on the suit of the gentleman at the bottom has left a bit of artifacting - a bit more care in the processing would even that out.  A fun and definitely different photo!</td>', 'The angle and the position of the actors creates a marvelous sense of energy to this!  Nice work for what is probably difficult lighting.  The recovery on the suit of the gentleman at the bottom has left a bit of artifacting - a bit more care in the processing would even that out.  A fun and definitely different photo!', '2011-08-01 23:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487897, 964768, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love how it appears they had their hair done just for this photo session.  Especially the light colored one.  :-)  Adorable!</td>', 'I love how it appears they had their hair done just for this photo session.  Especially the light colored one.  :-)  Adorable!', '2011-08-01 23:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487898, 964836, 112828, '<td valign="top">Huh... Not much to say here.  A reasonably well done shot of absolutely nothing.  Did you really get no pics of the guys sliding to a base, or a long stretch for a catch, or a beautiful swing?  Sorry, but this just seems so very static, there''s not a story here, just a ball or a strike. 5 for being a solid technical shot with the soul of a photo-zombie. :)</td>', 'Huh... Not much to say here.  A reasonably well done shot of absolutely nothing.  Did you really get no pics of the guys sliding to a base, or a long stretch for a catch, or a beautiful swing?  Sorry, but this just seems so very static, there''s not a story here, just a ball or a strike. 5 for being a solid technical shot with the soul of a photo-zombie. :)', '2011-08-01 23:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487899, 963484, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is simply a perfect fireworks shot.  Wonderful foreground, from the couple to the structure on the left, to the reflections and the skyline.  Then you have a great fireworks display on top of all of that!  Well done.</td>', 'This is simply a perfect fireworks shot.  Wonderful foreground, from the couple to the structure on the left, to the reflections and the skyline.  Then you have a great fireworks display on top of all of that!  Well done.', '2011-08-01 23:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487900, 963263, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile.  Simple but fascinating, and perfect in B&amp;W.</td>', 'This makes me smile.  Simple but fascinating, and perfect in B&W.', '2011-08-01 23:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487903, 964966, 30982, '<td valign="top">You get the impresion it was his wife, or perhaps his son.  And that he has the determination to carry that casket all by himself - it is his duty.</td>', 'You get the impresion it was his wife, or perhaps his son.  And that he has the determination to carry that casket all by himself - it is his duty.', '2011-08-01 23:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487904, 964933, 112828, '<td valign="top">Charming.  Even the tilt that I would normally dislike. The only thing that could have made this sparkle would have been a selective enhancement of her eyes, a bit of brightness increase, with a bit of sharpen, then a bit of saturation increase and this could have just really jumped out off the screen at you.</td>', 'Charming.  Even the tilt that I would normally dislike. The only thing that could have made this sparkle would have been a selective enhancement of her eyes, a bit of brightness increase, with a bit of sharpen, then a bit of saturation increase and this could have just really jumped out off the screen at you.', '2011-08-01 23:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487905, 964630, 30982, '<td valign="top">Exquisite detail - great macro.  They''re fascinating this close!  And just a wee bit frightening....</td>', 'Exquisite detail - great macro.  They''re fascinating this close!  And just a wee bit frightening....', '2011-08-01 23:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487906, 964414, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of high key.</td>', 'Very nice use of high key.', '2011-08-01 23:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487909, 964802, 112828, '<td valign="top">Jeez, that''s the shit nightmares are made out of!  I love it!!  Very well crafted image, I am quite in love with this.  The shadows are excellent, the symmetry is what completes the image, but the shadow draws the eye.</td>', 'Jeez, that''s the shit nightmares are made out of!  I love it!!  Very well crafted image, I am quite in love with this.  The shadows are excellent, the symmetry is what completes the image, but the shadow draws the eye.', '2011-08-01 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487910, 963678, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great color in this shot, and I like the composition.  This looks a little small compared to the other entries, though.  You''re allowed up to 800 pixels on the long side - make sure you use them!  If you have trouble trying to get the size right, you can ask for help in the forums.</td>', 'Great color in this shot, and I like the composition.  This looks a little small compared to the other entries, though.  You''re allowed up to 800 pixels on the long side - make sure you use them!  If you have trouble trying to get the size right, you can ask for help in the forums.', '2011-08-01 23:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487912, 964306, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the title, but I do like the shot alot.  Wonderful study of textures and tones.  She seems so weary.</td>', 'Not sure about the title, but I do like the shot alot.  Wonderful study of textures and tones.  She seems so weary.', '2011-08-02 00:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487914, 964622, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Great title for the shot. What is it with pugs and tongues?  :-)</td>', 'LOL!  Great title for the shot. What is it with pugs and tongues?  :-)', '2011-08-02 00:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487917, 964796, 108544, '<td valign="top">Stunning! I''m so happy you got this opportunity! There is nothing better, when it all comes together!<br/>Great work!</td>', 'Stunning! I''m so happy you got this opportunity! There is nothing better, when it all comes together!Great work!', '2011-08-02 00:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487919, 962862, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like how the reeds in the foreground are moving in the breeze - sets the mood very nicely.</td>', 'I like how the reeds in the foreground are moving in the breeze - sets the mood very nicely.', '2011-08-02 00:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487920, 964826, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a great expression - the face, the wing spread, the liftoff out of the water - works together well to create that sense of flight and fleeing.  Nice catch!</td>', 'What a great expression - the face, the wing spread, the liftoff out of the water - works together well to create that sense of flight and fleeing.  Nice catch!', '2011-08-02 00:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6487922, 963955, 30982, '<td valign="top">My but what round eyes you have!!  Very intense, and more than just a bit evil... he''s laughing at you, you know.  A bit of color noise and I''mnot sold on the horizontal framing bars.</td>', 'My but what round eyes you have!!  Very intense, and more than just a bit evil... he''s laughing at you, you know.  A bit of color noise and I''mnot sold on the horizontal framing bars.', '2011-08-02 00:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
