(6487937, 964982, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a lovely place!!  I''m sorry it''s so small, though - I want to be able to see it better!  There is a good tutorial here:  //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26<br/> <br/>That will help you size your photographs for submissions so you can take full advantage of the size allowed.  I hope that after the challenge is over, you post another larger version of this - it really is lovely.</td>', 'What a lovely place!!  I''m sorry it''s so small, though - I want to be able to see it better!  There is a good tutorial here:  //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26 That will help you size your photographs for submissions so you can take full advantage of the size allowed.  I hope that after the challenge is over, you post another larger version of this - it really is lovely.', '2011-08-02 00:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
