(6488765, 962249, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene, though details seem to be a little lost in it to me. I might have gotten down lower and close to that piece of driftwood and used it as a strong foreground element. Certainly worth a vote on the positive side of the scale, in spite of that nitpick.</td>', 'Very nice scene, though details seem to be a little lost in it to me. I might have gotten down lower and close to that piece of driftwood and used it as a strong foreground element. Certainly worth a vote on the positive side of the scale, in spite of that nitpick.', '2011-08-02 14:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
