(6488786, 962503, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if that is a lot of fish in the water, or just the texture of the ripples. Nothing is really grabbing me as the subject, but not coming off to me as an abstract either. Sorry.</td>', 'Not sure if that is a lot of fish in the water, or just the texture of the ripples. Nothing is really grabbing me as the subject, but not coming off to me as an abstract either. Sorry.', '2011-08-02 14:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
