(6488796, 964959, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ll bet you are just waiting for some smartbutt to comment about the motion blur on the wings and say something about shutter speed. What DOES it take to stop the wings of one of these?</td>', 'I''ll bet you are just waiting for some smartbutt to comment about the motion blur on the wings and say something about shutter speed. What DOES it take to stop the wings of one of these?', '2011-08-02 14:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488797, 961349, 47470, '<td valign="top">When someone is laying down or is upside down, you still have to light them right.  In this photo, the light is coming from "below" her face, which is called "monster lighting" because it''s not terribly flattering.  It''s not very strong monster lighting here, but still, light coming from "above" her would have worked better because the unusual pose of the model already makes the photo look a bit strange to the viewer, who is used to seeing people the right side up.</td>', 'When someone is laying down or is upside down, you still have to light them right.  In this photo, the light is coming from "below" her face, which is called "monster lighting" because it''s not terribly flattering.  It''s not very strong monster lighting here, but still, light coming from "above" her would have worked better because the unusual pose of the model already makes the photo look a bit strange to the viewer, who is used to seeing people the right side up.', '2011-08-02 14:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488804, 964525, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you would have left a bit of definition on the black shirt to separate it from the background because without that separation, it looks like the baby is being held by two severed arms. : /</td>', 'I wish you would have left a bit of definition on the black shirt to separate it from the background because without that separation, it looks like the baby is being held by two severed arms. : /', '2011-08-02 14:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488806, 961108, 47470, '<td valign="top">The saturation is a bit too high.  You''ve turned the bird cyan.</td>', 'The saturation is a bit too high.  You''ve turned the bird cyan.', '2011-08-02 14:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488807, 964644, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog know how to raise strong youngling. Start youngling off eating paper. When get to toddler, graduate to chew tree branch. Teen youngling get soft rocks. Grow up tough and great, like Grog.</td>', 'Grog know how to raise strong youngling. Start youngling off eating paper. When get to toddler, graduate to chew tree branch. Teen youngling get soft rocks. Grow up tough and great, like Grog.', '2011-08-02 14:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488808, 964706, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very cool scene!</td>', 'Very cool scene!', '2011-08-02 14:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488810, 964759, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog hunts bokeh. Grog say be quiet, do not scare away prey or tribe has no dinner.</td>', 'Grog hunts bokeh. Grog say be quiet, do not scare away prey or tribe has no dinner.', '2011-08-02 14:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488811, 961102, 47470, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the pose, the details, and the colors, but you could have done so much more with the lighting.  It looks like she is being lit by sun reflecting off the sidewalk in front of her, meaning the light is coming from below, which is not generally considered a flattering angle of light.  Adding a reflector to bounce some light on her from above would have added some really pretty light.</td>', 'I absolutely love the pose, the details, and the colors, but you could have done so much more with the lighting.  It looks like she is being lit by sun reflecting off the sidewalk in front of her, meaning the light is coming from below, which is not generally considered a flattering angle of light.  Adding a reflector to bounce some light on her from above would have added some really pretty light.', '2011-08-02 14:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488813, 963548, 54778, '<td valign="top">I''m not too convinced by the lack of colour in this image purely because I like the green of the grass and the plants when I''m stressed :) I think it would have helped if you had chosen either the tree or the bench as a focal point. They''re both vying for competition but neither one grabs it completely.</td>', 'I''m not too convinced by the lack of colour in this image purely because I like the green of the grass and the plants when I''m stressed :) I think it would have helped if you had chosen either the tree or the bench as a focal point. They''re both vying for competition but neither one grabs it completely.', '2011-08-02 14:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488814, 964361, 47470, '<td valign="top">I half expect to look back at her forehead and see a golden horn coming out of it.  What a pose!</td>', 'I half expect to look back at her forehead and see a golden horn coming out of it.  What a pose!', '2011-08-02 14:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488816, 962856, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very strange looking head indeed. Does look like a dandelion. Even with a big telephoto, you must have been awfully close.</td>', 'Very strange looking head indeed. Does look like a dandelion. Even with a big telephoto, you must have been awfully close.', '2011-08-02 14:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488817, 964874, 47470, '<td valign="top">I love the subtle play of light here.</td>', 'I love the subtle play of light here.', '2011-08-02 14:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488818, 964369, 47470, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the over-saturation works here, especially since it contradicts the title.</td>', 'I don''t think the over-saturation works here, especially since it contradicts the title.', '2011-08-02 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488821, 964708, 47470, '<td valign="top">This looks like a wonderful location, but I don''t think the post-processing brought out the best in this image.  I would have loved to see more detail pulled out.  The brightest parts of the image are somewhere between middle grey and light grey (instead of close to white).  The dark foreground doesn''t add the perspective of size that I would have preferred.  There is a lot of potential here though.</td>', 'This looks like a wonderful location, but I don''t think the post-processing brought out the best in this image.  I would have loved to see more detail pulled out.  The brightest parts of the image are somewhere between middle grey and light grey (instead of close to white).  The dark foreground doesn''t add the perspective of size that I would have preferred.  There is a lot of potential here though.', '2011-08-02 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488822, 964860, 54778, '<td valign="top">Slightly too oversaturated for my taste though the perspective is novel because it looks like you were standing in the water. I can feel the urgency of the stream because of it.</td>', 'Slightly too oversaturated for my taste though the perspective is novel because it looks like you were standing in the water. I can feel the urgency of the stream because of it.', '2011-08-02 14:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488823, 964074, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog make offering to god of hunt. Hunt good today, Grog bring home many mice for tribe. Females not like small rodent, hard to skin and remove bones. Grog appreciate all that hunt god do, but Grog must find different hunt god for mammoth.</td>', 'Grog make offering to god of hunt. Hunt good today, Grog bring home many mice for tribe. Females not like small rodent, hard to skin and remove bones. Grog appreciate all that hunt god do, but Grog must find different hunt god for mammoth.', '2011-08-02 14:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488825, 961218, 83313, '<td valign="top">What, a photo of Iceland without northern lights?!</td>', 'What, a photo of Iceland without northern lights?!', '2011-08-02 14:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488829, 964871, 47470, '<td valign="top">A bump in contrast to lighten the background a bit would have looked better, in my opinion.</td>', 'A bump in contrast to lighten the background a bit would have looked better, in my opinion.', '2011-08-02 14:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488833, 963891, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog haggle with old man. Trade female for strong horse. Grog say he drive hard bargain and was Grog''s favorite female. Grog lie. Man lie too. Horse not strong at all, but good meat and provide more meals for tribe than lazy female that not want to cook.</td>', 'Grog haggle with old man. Trade female for strong horse. Grog say he drive hard bargain and was Grog''s favorite female. Grog lie. Man lie too. Horse not strong at all, but good meat and provide more meals for tribe than lazy female that not want to cook.', '2011-08-02 14:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488835, 964706, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had pushed the bright parts of the image a bit more.  The outlines of the clouds, the crashing waves, and the brighter facades of the rocks should have been closer to white, in my opinion.</td>', 'I wish you had pushed the bright parts of the image a bit more.  The outlines of the clouds, the crashing waves, and the brighter facades of the rocks should have been closer to white, in my opinion.', '2011-08-02 14:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488837, 964768, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had used a slightly longer lens and a shallow depth of field to make this trio really stand out.</td>', 'I wish you had used a slightly longer lens and a shallow depth of field to make this trio really stand out.', '2011-08-02 14:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488841, 964454, 54778, '<td valign="top">This is a solid shot. Everything works technically esp. in the background and it does too in the foreground but the flowers aren''t the most memorable subject.  Maybe adding that stream I think I see in the back to the mix would have added to the composition.</td>', 'This is a solid shot. Everything works technically esp. in the background and it does too in the foreground but the flowers aren''t the most memorable subject.  Maybe adding that stream I think I see in the back to the mix would have added to the composition.', '2011-08-02 14:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488843, 964189, 47470, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this into a vertical, showing basically just what''s between the gate posts, putting the man almost in the center.  I think that''s where all the action is.</td>', 'I would have cropped this into a vertical, showing basically just what''s between the gate posts, putting the man almost in the center.  I think that''s where all the action is.', '2011-08-02 14:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488845, 963955, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish this was perfectly symmetrical.  I also think the cyan is too over-saturated, making the bird''s beak turn cyan when it shouldn''t be.</td>', 'I wish this was perfectly symmetrical.  I also think the cyan is too over-saturated, making the bird''s beak turn cyan when it shouldn''t be.', '2011-08-02 15:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488858, 964906, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think it''s interesting that you chose to not only leave in the "Private Property" sign, but that you also chose to highlight it with the title.  Not going for the easy "pretty field, water, clouds, and rainbow" shot was a very un-DPC choice : )  With different editing, I think this would have scored much higher on DPC, but you obviously weren''t aiming for that, which is cool too.</td>', 'I think it''s interesting that you chose to not only leave in the "Private Property" sign, but that you also chose to highlight it with the title.  Not going for the easy "pretty field, water, clouds, and rainbow" shot was a very un-DPC choice : )  With different editing, I think this would have scored much higher on DPC, but you obviously weren''t aiming for that, which is cool too.', '2011-08-02 15:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6488863, 963930, 47470, '<td valign="top">i wish the blue had been toned down just a bit so it would have been a little closer to looking natural, particularly in the foreground.</td>', 'i wish the blue had been toned down just a bit so it would have been a little closer to looking natural, particularly in the foreground.', '2011-08-02 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
