(6488874, 964719, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had waited for the sun to be a bit lower (which probably would have also mean you would have needed to move more to the right), so that you could have cropped closer in on the wind turbines, particularly on the sides.</td>', 'I wish you had waited for the sun to be a bit lower (which probably would have also mean you would have needed to move more to the right), so that you could have cropped closer in on the wind turbines, particularly on the sides.', '2011-08-02 15:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
