(6488890, 963891, 47470, '<td valign="top">I wish you had left a bit more saturation in the reds/oranges in his clothing, hat, and skin.  I also would have preferred a shallower depth of field.</td>', 'I wish you had left a bit more saturation in the reds/oranges in his clothing, hat, and skin.  I also would have preferred a shallower depth of field.', '2011-08-02 15:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
