(6489127, 964220, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful landscape. Maine is such an amazing place! Love the seagull. My only gripe is the powerful foamy wave is pulling my eyes towards it and distracting me from the overall scene. Maybe a faster shutter speed with stopped wave would have helped in giving it the wow factor.</td>', 'Beautiful landscape. Maine is such an amazing place! Love the seagull. My only gripe is the powerful foamy wave is pulling my eyes towards it and distracting me from the overall scene. Maybe a faster shutter speed with stopped wave would have helped in giving it the wow factor.', '2011-08-02 17:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489131, 964728, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great place and a beautiful composition! Looks like you walked across with the flash gun! Maybe a dusk shot would have worked better, because the stars are not doing much and the long exposure has added too much noise..</td>', 'Great place and a beautiful composition! Looks like you walked across with the flash gun! Maybe a dusk shot would have worked better, because the stars are not doing much and the long exposure has added too much noise..', '2011-08-02 17:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
