(6489180, 964668, 120171, '<td valign="top">Striking image, i have spent a lot of time looking at this image. Overall i really like it but i couldn''t figure out what i didn''t like. I don''t like the patch over the eye as it is too vivid and the shape is not what i would consider an authentic patch. The processing is really good but i would like to see it in an earthy colour (im probably thinking too much of pirates and the Caribbean) <br/>Like i say that''s all that i could find to critique in what is an excellent image.</td>', 'Striking image, i have spent a lot of time looking at this image. Overall i really like it but i couldn''t figure out what i didn''t like. I don''t like the patch over the eye as it is too vivid and the shape is not what i would consider an authentic patch. The processing is really good but i would like to see it in an earthy colour (im probably thinking too much of pirates and the Caribbean) Like i say that''s all that i could find to critique in what is an excellent image.', '2011-08-02 17:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
