(6489298, 963625, 136386, '<td valign="top">Amazing picture! I would be really interested to find out what kit you use. I am very interested in macro shots but do not have the kit for it. I am new to this website (joined this evening) and am not sure how to find your user profile so I have added mine. If you have a minute to leave me a message and some advice about macro I would be really grateful. If that''s not the done thing here then please do not worry. Bye for now!<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=136386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">NES</a></td>', 'Amazing picture! I would be really interested to find out what kit you use. I am very interested in macro shots but do not have the kit for it. I am new to this website (joined this evening) and am not sure how to find your user profile so I have added mine. If you have a minute to leave me a message and some advice about macro I would be really grateful. If that''s not the done thing here then please do not worry. Bye for now! NES', '2011-08-02 18:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489321, 964706, 39880, '<td valign="top">I really like the B&amp;W and think the it is a really good shot.  I think a slower shutter speed, to get the motion of the water, would make this even better.</td>', 'I really like the B&W and think the it is a really good shot.  I think a slower shutter speed, to get the motion of the water, would make this even better.', '2011-08-02 19:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
