(6489358, 964709, 59796, '<td valign="top">Multnomah falls! Such an amazing place!<br/>Glad you could separate out the top and bottom falls into two different lines instead of a single line. <br/>Unfortunately, light worked against this pic. The high contrast and glare kill what could''ve been an awesome pic, and turned it into a snapshot.</td>', 'Multnomah falls! Such an amazing place!Glad you could separate out the top and bottom falls into two different lines instead of a single line. Unfortunately, light worked against this pic. The high contrast and glare kill what could''ve been an awesome pic, and turned it into a snapshot.', '2011-08-02 19:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489365, 964792, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! A little too saturated for my taste, but Beautiful!!!</td>', 'Beautiful! A little too saturated for my taste, but Beautiful!!!', '2011-08-02 19:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489370, 964456, 59796, '<td valign="top">The place must''ve been awesome. Had you been there at sunrise or sunset and captured the same scene, it would''ve been magical - especially with those nice popcorn clouds in the sky. Unfortunately, the harsh lighting in this shot works against the picture. If you crop a little bit off the top so that the horizon falls on the 1/3 line, it would look a little better.</td>', 'The place must''ve been awesome. Had you been there at sunrise or sunset and captured the same scene, it would''ve been magical - especially with those nice popcorn clouds in the sky. Unfortunately, the harsh lighting in this shot works against the picture. If you crop a little bit off the top so that the horizon falls on the 1/3 line, it would look a little better.', '2011-08-02 19:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489371, 964529, 135486, '<td valign="top">Great crisp photo. Lots to look at. 10</td>', 'Great crisp photo. Lots to look at. 10', '2011-08-02 19:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489372, 960172, 135486, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. I''m not sure why, but I like the fact that you can''t see the cowboy''s eyes. 10</td>', 'Awesome capture. I''m not sure why, but I like the fact that you can''t see the cowboy''s eyes. 10', '2011-08-02 19:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489374, 963896, 135486, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t change anything about this shot</td>', 'I wouldn''t change anything about this shot', '2011-08-02 19:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489375, 964479, 135486, '<td valign="top">Black &amp; White was meant for moments like this. 9</td>', 'Black & White was meant for moments like this. 9', '2011-08-02 19:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489376, 963379, 135486, '<td valign="top">Great light on the mountain tops</td>', 'Great light on the mountain tops', '2011-08-02 19:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489377, 964796, 59796, '<td valign="top">Phew! What an amazing shot! What can I say that you won''t know already - your patience (and possibly, risk) in setting up this shot paid off handsomely and you''ve got a keeper.</td>', 'Phew! What an amazing shot! What can I say that you won''t know already - your patience (and possibly, risk) in setting up this shot paid off handsomely and you''ve got a keeper.', '2011-08-02 19:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489384, 964955, 59796, '<td valign="top">A nice enough scene. The sky doesn''t look angry enough to suggest the storm rolling in, primarily because it needs a bit of contrast boost. It''s a great idea to keep a little bit of the landscape in the picture to give the perspective. But the landscape doesn''t have any define-able features to look at - maybe a little more light on the landscape? I would shoot once for exposing the sky properly like you did, and once for exposing the land properly, and merge them as a HDR.</td>', 'A nice enough scene. The sky doesn''t look angry enough to suggest the storm rolling in, primarily because it needs a bit of contrast boost. It''s a great idea to keep a little bit of the landscape in the picture to give the perspective. But the landscape doesn''t have any define-able features to look at - maybe a little more light on the landscape? I would shoot once for exposing the sky properly like you did, and once for exposing the land properly, and merge them as a HDR.', '2011-08-02 19:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489387, 963607, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice! The underside of the pelican wings are exposed nicely enough to show the details, but the body looks a little burnt out because of overexposure.</td>', 'Nice! The underside of the pelican wings are exposed nicely enough to show the details, but the body looks a little burnt out because of overexposure.', '2011-08-02 19:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489391, 964605, 69325, '<td valign="top">brilliant</td>', 'brilliant', '2011-08-02 19:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489393, 962862, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The natural framing with bushes in the foreground is a nice touch. The dark, underexposed foliage and the moody skies add a foreboding to the picture. I would''ve chopped a little off the left of the pic because it doesn''t add anything to the picture and makes it a little off-balance I feel.</td>', 'Beautiful! The natural framing with bushes in the foreground is a nice touch. The dark, underexposed foliage and the moody skies add a foreboding to the picture. I would''ve chopped a little off the left of the pic because it doesn''t add anything to the picture and makes it a little off-balance I feel.', '2011-08-02 19:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489394, 964690, 16106, '<td valign="top">The skin tones you got out of this are amazing, just perfect light. The expressions are very good, my only knock is I wish you were a bit to your left to separate the faces of the four on the left a bit more, though it would cramp the fellow on the right. Never the less top marks, and a great take on fireworks.</td>', 'The skin tones you got out of this are amazing, just perfect light. The expressions are very good, my only knock is I wish you were a bit to your left to separate the faces of the four on the left a bit more, though it would cramp the fellow on the right. Never the less top marks, and a great take on fireworks.', '2011-08-02 19:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489396, 964980, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish you had a touch more contrast to get a true black on the birds, but other than that this is perfect. I especially like fact that you left that patch of open sky in the lower right.</td>', 'I wish you had a touch more contrast to get a true black on the birds, but other than that this is perfect. I especially like fact that you left that patch of open sky in the lower right.', '2011-08-02 19:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489397, 963484, 16106, '<td valign="top">this would be a very nice fireworks shot without the silhouettes, but they send it over to the next level. Ought to ribbon</td>', 'this would be a very nice fireworks shot without the silhouettes, but they send it over to the next level. Ought to ribbon', '2011-08-02 19:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489399, 964895, 16106, '<td valign="top">An amazing cloud capture, I just wish you had shot a bit wider to bring in some foreground. Beautifull capture, top ten.</td>', 'An amazing cloud capture, I just wish you had shot a bit wider to bring in some foreground. Beautifull capture, top ten.', '2011-08-02 19:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
