(6489514, 962455, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and great processing. The lost in thought expression doesn''t quite gel with this casual pose I think, but they''re both interesting in their own right.</td>', 'Nice capture and great processing. The lost in thought expression doesn''t quite gel with this casual pose I think, but they''re both interesting in their own right.', '2011-08-02 21:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
