(6489690, 964220, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nice BIF.  Overall this feels a little soft, it could be the processing, or the shot itself, but it''s just lacking that crispness that makes a shot really great.  Still, a good composition, and nice subject.. 7.</td>', 'Nice BIF.  Overall this feels a little soft, it could be the processing, or the shot itself, but it''s just lacking that crispness that makes a shot really great.  Still, a good composition, and nice subject.. 7.', '2011-08-02 23:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
