(6489698, 964838, 112828, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the subject is looking out of the frame, instead of into it.  It''s not a bad slice of life, but the composition just doesn''t work for me on this image.  (and more bokeh would have been good, as it is, the background looks a touch cluttered..) 6 for creative effort and reasonable technical aspects.</td>', 'It''s a shame the subject is looking out of the frame, instead of into it.  It''s not a bad slice of life, but the composition just doesn''t work for me on this image.  (and more bokeh would have been good, as it is, the background looks a touch cluttered..) 6 for creative effort and reasonable technical aspects.', '2011-08-02 23:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489702, 964965, 83313, '<td valign="top">This scene is begging for a humorous caption and I am drawing a blank. I may get back to this one...</td>', 'This scene is begging for a humorous caption and I am drawing a blank. I may get back to this one...', '2011-08-02 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489703, 964634, 112828, '<td valign="top">Two things here that are just killing the image:<br/> <br/>1. Reflections are <u><i>always</i></u> darker than the sky.<br/> <br/>2. Clouds should not be pink.<br/> <br/>An interesting subject though...  Good choice there.</td>', 'Two things here that are just killing the image: 1. Reflections are always darker than the sky. 2. Clouds should not be pink. An interesting subject though...  Good choice there.', '2011-08-02 23:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489705, 964857, 112828, '<td valign="top">Quaint.</td>', 'Quaint.', '2011-08-02 23:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489711, 963976, 112828, '<td valign="top">Plastic Fantastic!  (ok, not really, this isn''t a bad shot, but the denoise should have been used a  bit more sparingly...)</td>', 'Plastic Fantastic!  (ok, not really, this isn''t a bad shot, but the denoise should have been used a  bit more sparingly...)', '2011-08-02 23:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489723, 964860, 112828, '<td valign="top">What aperture were you at?  I''m guessing you knocked it wayyyy down because you didn''t have an ND filter handy?  --  I know this because I can see every speck of dust on your sensor - and you''ve got plenty of dust on that sensor.<br/> <br/>Outside of that issue, you''ve got some very strange color things going on, and a generally overprocessed feeling to the image... 5(E) for great effort.</td>', 'What aperture were you at?  I''m guessing you knocked it wayyyy down because you didn''t have an ND filter handy?  --  I know this because I can see every speck of dust on your sensor - and you''ve got plenty of dust on that sensor. Outside of that issue, you''ve got some very strange color things going on, and a generally overprocessed feeling to the image... 5(E) for great effort.', '2011-08-02 23:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489726, 962455, 112635, '<td valign="top">wow</td>', 'wow', '2011-08-02 23:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489727, 964778, 112828, '<td valign="top">I was tossing back and forth between 7 and 8.....<br/> <br/>Then I noticed that you had chopped off the top of the tree. :(<br/> <br/>6. :) :(</td>', 'I was tossing back and forth between 7 and 8..... Then I noticed that you had chopped off the top of the tree. :( 6. :) :(', '2011-08-02 23:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
