(6489739, 964242, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nice...  Don''t love the vignette, but... Whatever, cool image.</td>', 'Nice...  Don''t love the vignette, but... Whatever, cool image.', '2011-08-02 23:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489741, 962787, 114225, '<td valign="top">This style of shot is always fun :)</td>', 'This style of shot is always fun :)', '2011-08-02 23:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489742, 964558, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile!</td>', 'Makes me smile!', '2011-08-02 23:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489743, 964925, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice flow, interrupted only slightly by dust bunnies.  Two of them form eyes in one spot...</td>', 'A nice flow, interrupted only slightly by dust bunnies.  Two of them form eyes in one spot...', '2011-08-02 23:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489744, 962681, 112828, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I love what this does for the car.  Solid bodywork there too...  Even more impressive is that the black is color coat under the clear, instead of some crappy graphic sticker.  The vignette works well here too.</td>', 'Great shot.  I love what this does for the car.  Solid bodywork there too...  Even more impressive is that the black is color coat under the clear, instead of some crappy graphic sticker.  The vignette works well here too.', '2011-08-02 23:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489745, 964006, 30982, '<td valign="top">The mid jump is nice!  Great dusk color, too.</td>', 'The mid jump is nice!  Great dusk color, too.', '2011-08-02 23:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489746, 964765, 114225, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of long exposure. Add to that the symmetry and dynamics of this scene and you have a really great photo.</td>', 'Lovely use of long exposure. Add to that the symmetry and dynamics of this scene and you have a really great photo.', '2011-08-02 23:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489747, 964585, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful smiles! I especially love the girl with her eyes closed.  She''s either imagining an adventure yet to come or enjoying the one she just had.  This is what "the moment" is all about in photography.  It''s not grand or overstated, not processed to the nines - just a simple moment in time, full of smiles.</td>', 'Wonderful smiles! I especially love the girl with her eyes closed.  She''s either imagining an adventure yet to come or enjoying the one she just had.  This is what "the moment" is all about in photography.  It''s not grand or overstated, not processed to the nines - just a simple moment in time, full of smiles.', '2011-08-02 23:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489748, 964834, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great job capturing the details in the wrinkles. That adds a lot of character.</td>', 'Great job capturing the details in the wrinkles. That adds a lot of character.', '2011-08-02 23:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489749, 964648, 30982, '<td valign="top">Like it carries a miniature cathedral with its glorious windows every where it goes.</td>', 'Like it carries a miniature cathedral with its glorious windows every where it goes.', '2011-08-02 23:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489750, 964292, 114225, '<td valign="top">What a cute and imaginative way to show off the bands.</td>', 'What a cute and imaginative way to show off the bands.', '2011-08-02 23:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489751, 964388, 30982, '<td valign="top">Disconcerting and full of energy.</td>', 'Disconcerting and full of energy.', '2011-08-02 23:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489752, 964230, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent expression!</td>', 'Excellent expression!', '2011-08-02 23:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489753, 964925, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nothing personal, but as much as I''ve started to love pinhole images, I''ve also come to realize that a clean sensor is a must for this type of work...  Yours seems to be, well...  In need of a good cleaning.. *shrug* sorry, it''s a nice image, but the dust does kill the image''s artistic value for me.   The effect would be much worse on a larger print.</td>', 'Nothing personal, but as much as I''ve started to love pinhole images, I''ve also come to realize that a clean sensor is a must for this type of work...  Yours seems to be, well...  In need of a good cleaning.. *shrug* sorry, it''s a nice image, but the dust does kill the image''s artistic value for me.   The effect would be much worse on a larger print.', '2011-08-02 23:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489754, 964582, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully cooperative sky you had - lovely symmetry!</td>', 'What a wonderfully cooperative sky you had - lovely symmetry!', '2011-08-02 23:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489755, 964834, 30982, '<td valign="top">And a great candid it is, too!  What a face!</td>', 'And a great candid it is, too!  What a face!', '2011-08-02 23:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489758, 963765, 112828, '<td valign="top">The green in the foreground is overdone.  Otherwise this is a very nice image.</td>', 'The green in the foreground is overdone.  Otherwise this is a very nice image.', '2011-08-02 23:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489759, 964904, 30982, '<td valign="top">Summer, encapsulated.  Wonderful handling of the exposure, and the toning suits this beautifully!</td>', 'Summer, encapsulated.  Wonderful handling of the exposure, and the toning suits this beautifully!', '2011-08-02 23:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489760, 962455, 30982, '<td valign="top">The grain does indeed work quite well here.</td>', 'The grain does indeed work quite well here.', '2011-08-02 23:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6489762, 964796, 30982, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous rocks!  Will come back to see where this is.</td>', 'Gorgeous rocks!  Will come back to see where this is.', '2011-08-02 23:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
