(6491847, 964475, 131284, '<td valign="top">Nice. If I could change anything about this image it''d be to have his left hand and perhaps the furthest pieces a little more in focus, however that''s just my taste and I imagine the dof is as it is on purpose. Either way, this image is still really nice.</td>', 'Nice. If I could change anything about this image it''d be to have his left hand and perhaps the furthest pieces a little more in focus, however that''s just my taste and I imagine the dof is as it is on purpose. Either way, this image is still really nice.', '2011-08-03 19:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491848, 964172, 108069, '<td valign="top">That is pretty fantastic. Makes me want to play with it as well. Great stuff.</td>', 'That is pretty fantastic. Makes me want to play with it as well. Great stuff.', '2011-08-03 19:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491851, 964529, 108069, '<td valign="top">Outstanding capture. Sharp, crisp, the tones are great, wonderful stop action. If this isn''t Judi, take it as a supreme compliment. Excellent photo.</td>', 'Outstanding capture. Sharp, crisp, the tones are great, wonderful stop action. If this isn''t Judi, take it as a supreme compliment. Excellent photo.', '2011-08-03 19:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491856, 964826, 108069, '<td valign="top">Dinosaur? What a wonderful photo. Just the right blur of movement, sharp where it needs it, fabulous colors and contrast. Great stuff.</td>', 'Dinosaur? What a wonderful photo. Just the right blur of movement, sharp where it needs it, fabulous colors and contrast. Great stuff.', '2011-08-03 19:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491859, 960280, 131284, '<td valign="top">Intriguing, just the right amount of information is present to develop the scene slowly in my mind while allowing for creative freedom - this photo is a book, where most are the film adaptations =).<br/> <br/>I''d like to be able to take photos like this, perhaps I''ll give it a go next time I''m out.</td>', 'Intriguing, just the right amount of information is present to develop the scene slowly in my mind while allowing for creative freedom - this photo is a book, where most are the film adaptations =). I''d like to be able to take photos like this, perhaps I''ll give it a go next time I''m out.', '2011-08-03 19:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491860, 964865, 131284, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot, however the image is rather peaceful to me, contrary to the suggestion of the title... I guess we all interpret things differently =).</td>', 'I like this photo a lot, however the image is rather peaceful to me, contrary to the suggestion of the title... I guess we all interpret things differently =).', '2011-08-03 19:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491955, 964705, 126903, '<td valign="top">I like but would like to see this in colour,</td>', 'I like but would like to see this in colour,', '2011-08-03 20:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491978, 962389, 76335, '<td valign="top">A golden apparition. Nice.</td>', 'A golden apparition. Nice.', '2011-08-03 21:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491979, 963976, 76335, '<td valign="top">Looks like it''s been noise reduced to death. Not bad otherwise.</td>', 'Looks like it''s been noise reduced to death. Not bad otherwise.', '2011-08-03 21:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491981, 964151, 76335, '<td valign="top">Found like this? I hope. Captivating.</td>', 'Found like this? I hope. Captivating.', '2011-08-03 21:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491982, 964903, 76335, '<td valign="top">You kill me with these! Funny and yet... not. Happy to give this a ten.</td>', 'You kill me with these! Funny and yet... not. Happy to give this a ten.', '2011-08-03 21:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491983, 964838, 76335, '<td valign="top">Office candid? Interesting all that white.</td>', 'Office candid? Interesting all that white.', '2011-08-03 21:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491984, 963903, 76335, '<td valign="top">Stark. Severe. Real. <br/> <br/>Brave.</td>', 'Stark. Severe. Real.  Brave.', '2011-08-03 21:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491988, 964428, 76335, '<td valign="top">Normally not a fan of stylized images like this, but there''s something so surreal and sisnister and irresistable about this, that I can''t help but be taken in. <br/> <br/>That cloud. <br/> <br/>A nine for you (for now).</td>', 'Normally not a fan of stylized images like this, but there''s something so surreal and sisnister and irresistable about this, that I can''t help but be taken in.  That cloud.  A nine for you (for now).', '2011-08-03 21:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491989, 964915, 76335, '<td valign="top">Smartly composed. Lots to ponder here.</td>', 'Smartly composed. Lots to ponder here.', '2011-08-03 21:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491990, 964361, 76335, '<td valign="top">The portrait lighting makes this a jawdropper.</td>', 'The portrait lighting makes this a jawdropper.', '2011-08-03 21:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491992, 964756, 76335, '<td valign="top">So simple. So beautiful. So perfect.</td>', 'So simple. So beautiful. So perfect.', '2011-08-03 21:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491993, 964705, 76335, '<td valign="top">Images like these I count among my little treats for voting Free Studies. Wonderful.</td>', 'Images like these I count among my little treats for voting Free Studies. Wonderful.', '2011-08-03 21:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491995, 963977, 76335, '<td valign="top">Love how the ship and bird balance the composition.</td>', 'Love how the ship and bird balance the composition.', '2011-08-03 21:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491996, 964469, 76335, '<td valign="top">Beautiful in its severity. And vice versa.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-29 21:44:30.</i></td>', 'Beautiful in its severity. And vice versa.', '2011-08-03 21:26:03.000000', '2011-08-29 22:44:30.000000', 1),
(6491998, 964599, 76335, '<td valign="top">Stunning high key work. Love how the curves of her hair frame her face.</td>', 'Stunning high key work. Love how the curves of her hair frame her face.', '2011-08-03 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6491999, 963930, 76335, '<td valign="top">Stunning the way the water segues into the sky...</td>', 'Stunning the way the water segues into the sky...', '2011-08-03 21:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492001, 964839, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the careful arrangement of your composition.</td>', 'I love the careful arrangement of your composition.', '2011-08-03 21:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492004, 964767, 76335, '<td valign="top">Well, now, who could argue with this? I''m feeling <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> vibes here...</td>', 'Well, now, who could argue with this? I''m feeling  Yo_Spiff vibes here...', '2011-08-03 21:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492006, 964636, 76335, '<td valign="top">A great scene but the processing flattens it, feels a little bland.</td>', 'A great scene but the processing flattens it, feels a little bland.', '2011-08-03 21:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492007, 964456, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love when clouds and landforms seem to mimic each other...</td>', 'I love when clouds and landforms seem to mimic each other...', '2011-08-03 21:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492124, 962389, 65234, '<td valign="top">On the old screened-in porch at Gramma''s un-airconditioned house.  Love the light and tones and the mood they create.</td>', 'On the old screened-in porch at Gramma''s un-airconditioned house.  Love the light and tones and the mood they create.', '2011-08-03 23:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
