(6492333, 964613, 68504, '<td valign="top">Ah, another dropout from the recipe challenge. Stunning (sic).</td>', 'Ah, another dropout from the recipe challenge. Stunning (sic).', '2011-08-04 02:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492339, 964983, 68504, '<td valign="top">What a splendid match, this ducky family to water!  Resonances all over.</td>', 'What a splendid match, this ducky family to water!  Resonances all over.', '2011-08-04 02:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492340, 961349, 68504, '<td valign="top">I keep wondering if she is upside down, but I guess that is the kind of person Hannah is.<br/>Arresting.</td>', 'I keep wondering if she is upside down, but I guess that is the kind of person Hannah is.Arresting.', '2011-08-04 02:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492383, 964139, 108580, '<td valign="top">Looks like a typical winters morning (yellow sun), red earth and dry grass,  crisp and fresh and often cloudless. (And then it turns out to be a sunset!) Crystal clear and nice exposure control with back-lighting. is that a car approaching from the left...dust trail starting.</td>', 'Looks like a typical winters morning (yellow sun), red earth and dry grass,  crisp and fresh and often cloudless. (And then it turns out to be a sunset!) Crystal clear and nice exposure control with back-lighting. is that a car approaching from the left...dust trail starting.', '2011-08-04 02:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492386, 964854, 108580, '<td valign="top">Right up my own "candid from afar" style. Great posture and a good 90 degree POV to capture the body language. I think a bit heavy handed on the Topaz slider which is giving the image some bad edge haloing like on her chin and bottom lip and either side of the black strap over her shoulder as well as more noise than it needs.</td>', 'Right up my own "candid from afar" style. Great posture and a good 90 degree POV to capture the body language. I think a bit heavy handed on the Topaz slider which is giving the image some bad edge haloing like on her chin and bottom lip and either side of the black strap over her shoulder as well as more noise than it needs.', '2011-08-04 02:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492390, 964966, 108580, '<td valign="top">Oddly you don''t see a lot of funeral work. Sure it''s not the happiest time but certainly emotionally rich photographically speaking. Love the somber B&amp;W and each pall bearer has his/her own emotional look. The sole lady almost looks as if she is happy, with that huge bear grin. Maybe "The Mentalist" should comment :)</td>', 'Oddly you don''t see a lot of funeral work. Sure it''s not the happiest time but certainly emotionally rich photographically speaking. Love the somber B&W and each pall bearer has his/her own emotional look. The sole lady almost looks as if she is happy, with that huge bear grin. Maybe "The Mentalist" should comment :)', '2011-08-04 02:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492392, 964853, 108580, '<td valign="top">Green it is. Lovely location and barely touched with light. Super image.</td>', 'Green it is. Lovely location and barely touched with light. Super image.', '2011-08-04 02:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492395, 962424, 108580, '<td valign="top">This would be stunning if only you had used a faster s/s.</td>', 'This would be stunning if only you had used a faster s/s.', '2011-08-04 02:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
