(6492909, 962787, 136232, '<td valign="top">HAHAHAHA! Perfect, with the person blissfully unaware of the "danger". From the thumbnail it looked like you got a really impressive polarbear shot, but upclose you see the size is bigger than life. Great job on the sighting on this one, you can''t tell it''s a poster!</td>', 'HAHAHAHA! Perfect, with the person blissfully unaware of the "danger". From the thumbnail it looked like you got a really impressive polarbear shot, but upclose you see the size is bigger than life. Great job on the sighting on this one, you can''t tell it''s a poster!', '2011-08-04 13:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
