(6492916, 964428, 136232, '<td valign="top">I''m really impressed with the colors of this one.  The Lake and sky looks as if it''s glowing, but the trees and house are a bit more muted pastels.</td>', 'I''m really impressed with the colors of this one.  The Lake and sky looks as if it''s glowing, but the trees and house are a bit more muted pastels.', '2011-08-04 13:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492923, 964728, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the stars and sunset in the background, but I''m a little confused on the bluish greens comming from the grape vines. It might look better if you had the bushes on the left blend into the color as the vine gets further away from the viewer.  On the right I''m not sure if the light is just hitting the top of the branches or it''s lighting up some sort of tree behind them.  The upper left corner, if you cut the photo diagonally, looks very detailed, intricate and awesome. The bottom right just seems more bland/shadow. Something placed on the bottom right, like a hoe or a wine barrel might help give the bottom right something.</td>', 'I like the stars and sunset in the background, but I''m a little confused on the bluish greens comming from the grape vines. It might look better if you had the bushes on the left blend into the color as the vine gets further away from the viewer.  On the right I''m not sure if the light is just hitting the top of the branches or it''s lighting up some sort of tree behind them.  The upper left corner, if you cut the photo diagonally, looks very detailed, intricate and awesome. The bottom right just seems more bland/shadow. Something placed on the bottom right, like a hoe or a wine barrel might help give the bottom right something.', '2011-08-04 13:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492928, 963678, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the use of shadows.  I feel as if you changed the angle just a little more the silhouettes of the flowers would be more interesting.  The grasses seem to form very strong lines, which can be visually a bit overwhelming.  If you crop it a little moe off the right and bottom say, you''d still get the gist of the picture without your eyes being drawn every which way.</td>', 'I like the use of shadows.  I feel as if you changed the angle just a little more the silhouettes of the flowers would be more interesting.  The grasses seem to form very strong lines, which can be visually a bit overwhelming.  If you crop it a little moe off the right and bottom say, you''d still get the gist of the picture without your eyes being drawn every which way.', '2011-08-04 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492932, 964479, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the curve of the wave, very dramatic. The mist coming from the topmakes it look even bigger.</td>', 'I like the curve of the wave, very dramatic. The mist coming from the topmakes it look even bigger.', '2011-08-04 13:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
