(6492956, 962799, 136232, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of when I volunteered at Ohio Wildlife Center.  Hawks are super resilient creatures, even though they use their super-eyesight to catch prey, they can still adapt.  You can still get a sens of the eye in this one, and he''s looking straight at you, not turning his head so his good eye can see you.</td>', 'Reminds me of when I volunteered at Ohio Wildlife Center.  Hawks are super resilient creatures, even though they use their super-eyesight to catch prey, they can still adapt.  You can still get a sens of the eye in this one, and he''s looking straight at you, not turning his head so his good eye can see you.', '2011-08-04 14:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492960, 961349, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the framing/silhouette of this one.  The strong deep browns of her hair/eye are a good contrast to the subtle pinks of the skin and lips.</td>', 'I love the framing/silhouette of this one.  The strong deep browns of her hair/eye are a good contrast to the subtle pinks of the skin and lips.', '2011-08-04 14:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492965, 964838, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how the woman looks in the background, but would ahve liked a little more contrast in the background.  Offices do tend to be that shade of off white though.</td>', 'I like how the woman looks in the background, but would ahve liked a little more contrast in the background.  Offices do tend to be that shade of off white though.', '2011-08-04 14:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492966, 964840, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the bent effect of what looks like a giraffe feeder, makes it ever more looming (fish eye lense?)  The forboding sky, the way she''s humbly barefoot on the grass, makes it fit the theme of David and Goliath.</td>', 'I like the bent effect of what looks like a giraffe feeder, makes it ever more looming (fish eye lense?)  The forboding sky, the way she''s humbly barefoot on the grass, makes it fit the theme of David and Goliath.', '2011-08-04 14:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492970, 964363, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the beautiful fantasy colors of this one. The purples highlighted in the bush in the front, the subtle greens in the back.  I love how you made something usually overlooked, like a bush, and made it the most textured/highlighted portion of the piece.</td>', 'I love the beautiful fantasy colors of this one. The purples highlighted in the bush in the front, the subtle greens in the back.  I love how you made something usually overlooked, like a bush, and made it the most textured/highlighted portion of the piece.', '2011-08-04 14:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492971, 962648, 136232, '<td valign="top">Cirque de Sole?</td>', 'Cirque de Sole?', '2011-08-04 14:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492973, 964343, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice double entendre in the title. I like the shape/angle of the cross.  I think I now see why fanboys go to comic conventions so religiously.</td>', 'Nice double entendre in the title. I like the shape/angle of the cross.  I think I now see why fanboys go to comic conventions so religiously.', '2011-08-04 14:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492976, 964980, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love how this is an early morning shot, with the bright colors in the background and yellow highlights. You caputred a rare moment, seeing baby woodpeckers feeding from their hidy-hole.</td>', 'I love how this is an early morning shot, with the bright colors in the background and yellow highlights. You caputred a rare moment, seeing baby woodpeckers feeding from their hidy-hole.', '2011-08-04 14:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492978, 963211, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog invent new popular sport. Call game "Grogball". Only rule is Grog make up rules. Grog make new rule say when other tribe catch ball, kaptan of tribe must hit head against ground until hurt. Kaptan of other tribe thinks kaptan is smart and wear helmet, but Grog is smarter. Grog make new rule say helmet not allowed. Other tribe in violashun of rule and diskwalifyd from game. Tribe of Grog win again!! Grog is grate sportsman.</td>', 'Grog invent new popular sport. Call game "Grogball". Only rule is Grog make up rules. Grog make new rule say when other tribe catch ball, kaptan of tribe must hit head against ground until hurt. Kaptan of other tribe thinks kaptan is smart and wear helmet, but Grog is smarter. Grog make new rule say helmet not allowed. Other tribe in violashun of rule and diskwalifyd from game. Tribe of Grog win again!! Grog is grate sportsman.', '2011-08-04 14:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492983, 963395, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the ethereal feel of this picture. The treyish purple shape in the background middleright of the picture doesn''t seem to add much to the scene, I feel if you edited it out/blackened it you''d get a better picture. Right now it takes away from the lit geese.<br/> <br/>I looks like you can get two neat visuals from this one shot by just drawing a line through the middle, with the left being a bright glade and the right being more storybook fantasy glow.</td>', 'I like the ethereal feel of this picture. The treyish purple shape in the background middleright of the picture doesn''t seem to add much to the scene, I feel if you edited it out/blackened it you''d get a better picture. Right now it takes away from the lit geese. I looks like you can get two neat visuals from this one shot by just drawing a line through the middle, with the left being a bright glade and the right being more storybook fantasy glow.', '2011-08-04 14:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492984, 962249, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the colors/time of day this was taken. The grey branch really helps to break up the red brush near the front.</td>', 'I love the colors/time of day this was taken. The grey branch really helps to break up the red brush near the front.', '2011-08-04 14:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492986, 963031, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful scene. Major nitpick, however. You have used far too much JPEG compression when you saved this, and I can see some compression artifacts in the sky around the tops of the hills. The 85k file size supports this as well. With a 300k limit, you could have used much less compression and your image would have had greater clarity. Compression kills detail. Always use as little as you can and still fit into the challenge specs. As it is, I will probably be the only one to notice that aspect and I do expect this to perform quite well.</td>', 'Wonderful scene. Major nitpick, however. You have used far too much JPEG compression when you saved this, and I can see some compression artifacts in the sky around the tops of the hills. The 85k file size supports this as well. With a 300k limit, you could have used much less compression and your image would have had greater clarity. Compression kills detail. Always use as little as you can and still fit into the challenge specs. As it is, I will probably be the only one to notice that aspect and I do expect this to perform quite well.', '2011-08-04 14:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492987, 964668, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love how the title adds to the piece.  Helps set the mood of a sorrowed pirate.  I like how you included his tatoos into the portrait, to make him more of a ruffian.</td>', 'I love how the title adds to the piece.  Helps set the mood of a sorrowed pirate.  I like how you included his tatoos into the portrait, to make him more of a ruffian.', '2011-08-04 14:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492988, 964710, 136232, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. My nitpick would be just to crop out a small half inch on the right so it doesn''t look like the tree and brush are connected.  Great silhouettes.</td>', 'I really like this one. My nitpick would be just to crop out a small half inch on the right so it doesn''t look like the tree and brush are connected.  Great silhouettes.', '2011-08-04 14:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492989, 964762, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the message or story is here. Perhaps you are suggesting she should apply?  ;-}</td>', 'Not sure what the message or story is here. Perhaps you are suggesting she should apply?  ;-}', '2011-08-04 14:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492990, 964139, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the backlighting.</td>', 'I like the backlighting.', '2011-08-04 14:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492992, 964802, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oh, kewl!</td>', 'Oh, kewl!', '2011-08-04 14:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492996, 962503, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice textures of the water, rock/grass. I wonder how you got this effect.</td>', 'Nice textures of the water, rock/grass. I wonder how you got this effect.', '2011-08-04 14:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6492999, 964903, 136232, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shapes.  The slight pink shape looks like it could be a flower of the bride.  Makes me take a second look.</td>', 'Very interesting shapes.  The slight pink shape looks like it could be a flower of the bride.  Makes me take a second look.', '2011-08-04 14:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493000, 964309, 136232, '<td valign="top">The splash makes almost a lip-like shape.</td>', 'The splash makes almost a lip-like shape.', '2011-08-04 14:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493001, 962177, 136232, '<td valign="top">A rare site indeed.</td>', 'A rare site indeed.', '2011-08-04 14:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493004, 963891, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice pastel colors.  Soft expression with shetland ponies in the background. the sky silhouettes his hat/face.</td>', 'Nice pastel colors.  Soft expression with shetland ponies in the background. the sky silhouettes his hat/face.', '2011-08-04 14:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493009, 964632, 83313, '<td valign="top">I never realized that genies were so young looking. I guess if you have that sort of power at your disposal, why stick with the old &amp; creepy stereotype?<br/> <br/>Added: Raising my vote a tad, not for the photographic quality, but for the eye to recognize an interesting thing like this when it presented itself.</td>', 'I never realized that genies were so young looking. I guess if you have that sort of power at your disposal, why stick with the old & creepy stereotype? Added: Raising my vote a tad, not for the photographic quality, but for the eye to recognize an interesting thing like this when it presented itself.', '2011-08-04 14:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493011, 962867, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice detail on the hummingbird''s feathers. If you crop a little from the right/left side you can make a slightly taller rectangle, which would draw the eye even more into the piece.</td>', 'Nice detail on the hummingbird''s feathers. If you crop a little from the right/left side you can make a slightly taller rectangle, which would draw the eye even more into the piece.', '2011-08-04 14:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493012, 964693, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the silhouette and texture on the skin.</td>', 'I love the silhouette and texture on the skin.', '2011-08-04 14:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493013, 964960, 136232, '<td valign="top">I''m amazed you can get the timing right on these splashes.  Are you doing them in some sort of saucer, or pond?</td>', 'I''m amazed you can get the timing right on these splashes.  Are you doing them in some sort of saucer, or pond?', '2011-08-04 14:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493014, 964390, 136232, '<td valign="top">I get a sense of friendly urban culture in this one. The pale colors of blue with the rich browns make this piece! It looks as if he''s offering you the banjo to play.</td>', 'I get a sense of friendly urban culture in this one. The pale colors of blue with the rich browns make this piece! It looks as if he''s offering you the banjo to play.', '2011-08-04 14:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493017, 964074, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the panoramic shape of this one, it helps lengthen the light around the cat.  I also like the reflection in the mirror, as if the light''s going into another world.</td>', 'I like the panoramic shape of this one, it helps lengthen the light around the cat.  I also like the reflection in the mirror, as if the light''s going into another world.', '2011-08-04 14:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493018, 964880, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice panning shot! the horse looks perfect. I even love how you caught the whites of its eyes. Looks like a painting.</td>', 'Nice panning shot! the horse looks perfect. I even love how you caught the whites of its eyes. Looks like a painting.', '2011-08-04 14:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493020, 963933, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the trees silhouetted against the white mountain.   Looks very three dimensional to me with the mist.</td>', 'I love the trees silhouetted against the white mountain.   Looks very three dimensional to me with the mist.', '2011-08-04 14:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493023, 964482, 136232, '<td valign="top">I feel a sense of vertigo with this one</td>', 'I feel a sense of vertigo with this one', '2011-08-04 14:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493024, 963583, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how you used color to bring out the veins in the petals of the flower.  I also love how a few of the leaves in the background are green, to make an interesting silhouette.</td>', 'I like how you used color to bring out the veins in the petals of the flower.  I also love how a few of the leaves in the background are green, to make an interesting silhouette.', '2011-08-04 14:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493025, 964703, 136232, '<td valign="top">Interesting flower.  Might have been interesting to see how it would have looked with you standing right behind the bee with the petals giving contrast to the bee''s body.</td>', 'Interesting flower.  Might have been interesting to see how it would have looked with you standing right behind the bee with the petals giving contrast to the bee''s body.', '2011-08-04 14:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493027, 964848, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice shapes, perfect black background as to not draw away from the flower.</td>', 'Nice shapes, perfect black background as to not draw away from the flower.', '2011-08-04 14:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493034, 964632, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the positioning. The child looks as if she''s a genie comming from a botte, along with the mist and rainbow. I feel like if you cropped off from the top of the fence up, you''d be less distracted by the sky.  You''d also have a more mystical feel to the setting, since you wouldn''t know if you were in the woods/mountains/city/ect.</td>', 'I love the positioning. The child looks as if she''s a genie comming from a botte, along with the mist and rainbow. I feel like if you cropped off from the top of the fence up, you''d be less distracted by the sky.  You''d also have a more mystical feel to the setting, since you wouldn''t know if you were in the woods/mountains/city/ect.', '2011-08-04 14:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493035, 964854, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the extreme texture of the skin and hair.  I also love the framming.</td>', 'I love the extreme texture of the skin and hair.  I also love the framming.', '2011-08-04 14:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493036, 962052, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice panoramic lighting with the clouds.</td>', 'Nice panoramic lighting with the clouds.', '2011-08-04 14:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493037, 962253, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, I feel as if you somehow could overexpose the water a bit more you''d get more the ripples on the water and silhouette of the boat.</td>', 'I like the idea, I feel as if you somehow could overexpose the water a bit more you''d get more the ripples on the water and silhouette of the boat.', '2011-08-04 14:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493039, 964879, 136232, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouette.</td>', 'Very nice silhouette.', '2011-08-04 14:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493040, 964430, 136232, '<td valign="top">Interesting shapes.  I feel as if your camera was more focused on the bark of the tree than the feathers of the bird, but then again feathers are naturally more softer than bark.</td>', 'Interesting shapes.  I feel as if your camera was more focused on the bark of the tree than the feathers of the bird, but then again feathers are naturally more softer than bark.', '2011-08-04 14:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493041, 964644, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections of the wide eyes.</td>', 'I like the reflections of the wide eyes.', '2011-08-04 14:48:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(6493042, 964775, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette</td>', 'Nice silhouette', '2011-08-04 14:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493044, 964802, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love how you only see half of the spider.  At firt it looks like it''s crawling over the edge, but then you see the other half of the body silhouette through the fabric.</td>', 'I love how you only see half of the spider.  At firt it looks like it''s crawling over the edge, but then you see the other half of the body silhouette through the fabric.', '2011-08-04 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493047, 963502, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice gritty texture of the face and hair.  I also love the color choice of browns and deep gray-purples</td>', 'Nice gritty texture of the face and hair.  I also love the color choice of browns and deep gray-purples', '2011-08-04 14:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493049, 964568, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  It looks like he''s just about to fall but he''s still going forward.</td>', 'Nice angle.  It looks like he''s just about to fall but he''s still going forward.', '2011-08-04 14:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493050, 964454, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how the blues of the flowers in the foreground are repeated in the sky of the background. The small hint of a river/stream near the middle helps give depth.</td>', 'I like how the blues of the flowers in the foreground are repeated in the sky of the background. The small hint of a river/stream near the middle helps give depth.', '2011-08-04 14:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493052, 964431, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of sepia/black.  Makes it a moment of the past, and the hands look like flickering flames.</td>', 'I like the choice of sepia/black.  Makes it a moment of the past, and the hands look like flickering flames.', '2011-08-04 14:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493054, 964965, 136232, '<td valign="top">HAHA, I love the stop action of this shot.  The diagonal angle is great, and the expression on the guys faces are perfect.  Makes me feel as if there is a story behind this one.</td>', 'HAHA, I love the stop action of this shot.  The diagonal angle is great, and the expression on the guys faces are perfect.  Makes me feel as if there is a story behind this one.', '2011-08-04 14:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493055, 964981, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the glowing behind the children, with the sunset to stars skyline.  The ripples of the sand come out beautifully, and the rock mountain in the water makes it more interesting.</td>', 'I love the glowing behind the children, with the sunset to stars skyline.  The ripples of the sand come out beautifully, and the rock mountain in the water makes it more interesting.', '2011-08-04 14:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493056, 964407, 136232, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting to see everyone of darker skin in-contrast to the bright white clothes. This is a non-typical day at the beach, with what looks like a private school visiting.</td>', 'It''s interesting to see everyone of darker skin in-contrast to the bright white clothes. This is a non-typical day at the beach, with what looks like a private school visiting.', '2011-08-04 14:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493057, 963548, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.  I don''t know if you meant to put the card in the bushes, but if you put it closer to the middle it might help up the extreme texture of them.</td>', 'I like the composition.  I don''t know if you meant to put the card in the bushes, but if you put it closer to the middle it might help up the extreme texture of them.', '2011-08-04 14:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493059, 964857, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the style of the old fashioned lamp with the older car, older clothes, and older house.  I feel as if the bright brown/green doesn''t add much too the piece.  I feel as if the color was changed to a bit more pastel that it would look even more like a 1956 photograph and complement the pastel of the car.</td>', 'I like the style of the old fashioned lamp with the older car, older clothes, and older house.  I feel as if the bright brown/green doesn''t add much too the piece.  I feel as if the color was changed to a bit more pastel that it would look even more like a 1956 photograph and complement the pastel of the car.', '2011-08-04 15:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493060, 963770, 136232, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors captured on the mountain</td>', 'Beautiful colors captured on the mountain', '2011-08-04 15:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493062, 964227, 136232, '<td valign="top">Simplistic and cute.</td>', 'Simplistic and cute.', '2011-08-04 15:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493065, 964953, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice juxtaposition of lines and mottled clouds. At firt it looked like a cage with a dramatic background.  It could also be a massive skyscraper. I love the overall textured effect.</td>', 'Nice juxtaposition of lines and mottled clouds. At firt it looked like a cage with a dramatic background.  It could also be a massive skyscraper. I love the overall textured effect.', '2011-08-04 15:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493069, 964511, 136232, '<td valign="top">hehe  I think bikes have a natural slimming effect, as they instantly make you look athletic.  The photo looks a bit "weighted" on the left side (pardon the pun) as there is much more to look at there than the right sky/road.  I feel if you''d crop out a bit on the right side to the last biker, you''d still get the feel of the very long road you''re biking on and make the front biker more the center of the photograph.</td>', 'hehe  I think bikes have a natural slimming effect, as they instantly make you look athletic.  The photo looks a bit "weighted" on the left side (pardon the pun) as there is much more to look at there than the right sky/road.  I feel if you''d crop out a bit on the right side to the last biker, you''d still get the feel of the very long road you''re biking on and make the front biker more the center of the photograph.', '2011-08-04 15:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493070, 964777, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice, Ilike how the earrings complement the design on the tank top.</td>', 'Nice, Ilike how the earrings complement the design on the tank top.', '2011-08-04 15:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493071, 964559, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice lounging shot.</td>', 'Nice lounging shot.', '2011-08-04 15:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493073, 963552, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how the bluebird stands out from the pale/pastel background in flight, and how it is mirrored by another bluebird.</td>', 'I like how the bluebird stands out from the pale/pastel background in flight, and how it is mirrored by another bluebird.', '2011-08-04 15:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493074, 964962, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice/intense colors.  The reflection is perfect, I was wondering whether or not I was looking out from a cave or through a canyon.  I love how the rocks disappearinto the water.</td>', 'Nice/intense colors.  The reflection is perfect, I was wondering whether or not I was looking out from a cave or through a canyon.  I love how the rocks disappearinto the water.', '2011-08-04 15:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493079, 964271, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice lizard.  It might have been neat if you could have gotten even further down looking op at the lizard, with him pointing his face down to look at you. I also feel if you cropped a little off the top you''d get a longer rectangle to bring attention to the lizard''s body</td>', 'Nice lizard.  It might have been neat if you could have gotten even further down looking op at the lizard, with him pointing his face down to look at you. I also feel if you cropped a little off the top you''d get a longer rectangle to bring attention to the lizard''s body', '2011-08-04 15:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493080, 963697, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the textures in the sand. Nice use of sepia, you still have bright highlights and dark shadows.</td>', 'I love the textures in the sand. Nice use of sepia, you still have bright highlights and dark shadows.', '2011-08-04 15:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493082, 964529, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot, and I even love how every single person is wearing a cowboy hat.  I even love the light you captured in the dust the bull is kicking up.</td>', 'Nice action shot, and I even love how every single person is wearing a cowboy hat.  I even love the light you captured in the dust the bull is kicking up.', '2011-08-04 15:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493083, 964456, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nic clean feel of the water against rocks, and I like how the rocks are mirrored inthe circular clouds becoming smaller further back in the sky.</td>', 'Nic clean feel of the water against rocks, and I like how the rocks are mirrored inthe circular clouds becoming smaller further back in the sky.', '2011-08-04 15:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493085, 964348, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like the highlights and shadows of this one! It looks like a solid metallic drill instead of water.  The bubbles give a sense of motion, but could also be like snow falling in the sky around it.  I even love the interesting shapes in the background, they are definate but I"m not quite sure what of.</td>', 'I like the highlights and shadows of this one! It looks like a solid metallic drill instead of water.  The bubbles give a sense of motion, but could also be like snow falling in the sky around it.  I even love the interesting shapes in the background, they are definate but I"m not quite sure what of.', '2011-08-04 15:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493086, 964901, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how the fronds of the grass are contrasted by the blackness of the sea. The white beach contrasted to the dark ocean.</td>', 'I like how the fronds of the grass are contrasted by the blackness of the sea. The white beach contrasted to the dark ocean.', '2011-08-04 15:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493088, 964768, 136232, '<td valign="top">Nice horses.</td>', 'Nice horses.', '2011-08-04 15:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493091, 960172, 136232, '<td valign="top">I love the Glowing dust in this picture, and how it''s kicked up into the cowboy''s face! The framing is perfect, and creates an interesting silhouette.  I love how you can see the texture on the hat, and mud on the bull! Very Western!</td>', 'I love the Glowing dust in this picture, and how it''s kicked up into the cowboy''s face! The framing is perfect, and creates an interesting silhouette.  I love how you can see the texture on the hat, and mud on the bull! Very Western!', '2011-08-04 15:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493092, 964226, 136232, '<td valign="top">I like how the woman is painted, giving an oaklike feel to her.</td>', 'I like how the woman is painted, giving an oaklike feel to her.', '2011-08-04 15:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
