(6493326, 964337, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! <br/>The natural colors, the smooth bokeh, the butterfly pose - they all work nicely together. Love it!<br/>I wish it wasn''t such a tight crop on the wing tips though, and that the aspect ratio is more traditional.</td>', 'Beautiful! The natural colors, the smooth bokeh, the butterfly pose - they all work nicely together. Love it!I wish it wasn''t such a tight crop on the wing tips though, and that the aspect ratio is more traditional.', '2011-08-04 19:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
