(6493331, 964147, 108580, '<td valign="top">What a candid. (I hope). If so super eye for a story.</td>', 'What a candid. (I hope). If so super eye for a story.', '2011-08-04 19:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493334, 963583, 59796, '<td valign="top">The processing is a bit too grungy for me for a flower shot. And I don''t quite get the point of green color - might as well desaturate green to leave the flower alone? Also, the harsh light fails to show off the flower as a gentle thing of beauty. Love the petal textures that came out because of this processing though. Looks like I''m not getting your intent here :(</td>', 'The processing is a bit too grungy for me for a flower shot. And I don''t quite get the point of green color - might as well desaturate green to leave the flower alone? Also, the harsh light fails to show off the flower as a gentle thing of beauty. Love the petal textures that came out because of this processing though. Looks like I''m not getting your intent here :(', '2011-08-04 19:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493336, 964306, 108580, '<td valign="top">Super time capture candid. Great B&amp;W PP</td>', 'Super time capture candid. Great B&W PP', '2011-08-04 19:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493338, 964414, 108580, '<td valign="top">Powerful. Thought provoking.</td>', 'Powerful. Thought provoking.', '2011-08-04 19:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493340, 964840, 108580, '<td valign="top">Clever use of lens perspective and distortion.</td>', 'Clever use of lens perspective and distortion.', '2011-08-04 19:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493342, 963891, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice! <br/>Might as well convert it into BW right? The subtle tones don''t really add to the picture and are mildly distracting as it seems a little dull. Interesting that he appears to wear a uniform in a field?<br/> <br/>An intriguing picture that makes me think and wonder what the story behind him is.</td>', 'Nice! Might as well convert it into BW right? The subtle tones don''t really add to the picture and are mildly distracting as it seems a little dull. Interesting that he appears to wear a uniform in a field? An intriguing picture that makes me think and wonder what the story behind him is.', '2011-08-04 19:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493343, 960717, 59796, '<td valign="top">A fun riot of colors. The spiral blur achieved "In camera"? Or through post-processing? Either way, a nice little abstract. I wish the focal point was more along the rule-of-thirds though.</td>', 'A fun riot of colors. The spiral blur achieved "In camera"? Or through post-processing? Either way, a nice little abstract. I wish the focal point was more along the rule-of-thirds though.', '2011-08-04 19:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493348, 964914, 59796, '<td valign="top">The part in focus is just plain amazing. I love the leading lines, the simple pattern and the delicate feel of the feather. The crisp reflection adds even more beauty. The out-of-focus back of the feather is highly distracting though. It appears unruly and contradicting everything the in-focus part stands for.</td>', 'The part in focus is just plain amazing. I love the leading lines, the simple pattern and the delicate feel of the feather. The crisp reflection adds even more beauty. The out-of-focus back of the feather is highly distracting though. It appears unruly and contradicting everything the in-focus part stands for.', '2011-08-04 19:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493352, 962594, 59796, '<td valign="top">A strong subject with a creamy background. The eye is fabulous and captures all the attention. Very nice! <br/>The lighting''s a little harsh though - it probably adds to the picture by making the bird look more like a predator than otherwise, but it''s noticeable (especially the harsh shadow on the chin), and is therefore slightly distracting.</td>', 'A strong subject with a creamy background. The eye is fabulous and captures all the attention. Very nice! The lighting''s a little harsh though - it probably adds to the picture by making the bird look more like a predator than otherwise, but it''s noticeable (especially the harsh shadow on the chin), and is therefore slightly distracting.', '2011-08-04 19:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493355, 964962, 59796, '<td valign="top">A snow-topped blue mountain, no less!<br/>Good imagination and capture. I wish the water a bit more still for you - then it would be wall frame-worthy. As it is, I love the lines in the pic.</td>', 'A snow-topped blue mountain, no less!Good imagination and capture. I wish the water a bit more still for you - then it would be wall frame-worthy. As it is, I love the lines in the pic.', '2011-08-04 19:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493357, 964879, 59796, '<td valign="top">Neat! I don''t know how long hummers rest, but it can''t have been easy to spot one and take a picture of one without waiting forever. And that too in such nice light, and outdoors with all the wind. Amazing...</td>', 'Neat! I don''t know how long hummers rest, but it can''t have been easy to spot one and take a picture of one without waiting forever. And that too in such nice light, and outdoors with all the wind. Amazing...', '2011-08-04 19:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493360, 964884, 59796, '<td valign="top">.. or face the consequences :) <br/>I''d submit for sure! :)<br/> <br/>Nice concept and execution. The only thing distracting is a double line for shadows - possibly from two different harsh light sources..</td>', '.. or face the consequences :) I''d submit for sure! :) Nice concept and execution. The only thing distracting is a double line for shadows - possibly from two different harsh light sources..', '2011-08-04 19:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493364, 964634, 59796, '<td valign="top">A wonderful setting to take a break.<br/>The HDR-like processing of the clouds is not very appealing to me though. The white of the clouds becomes a dirty white (or grey if you will). I like the reflection better. And I wouldn''t even mind a crop of this that chops off the clouds on the top - the reflection is what hogs all the attention anyway.</td>', 'A wonderful setting to take a break.The HDR-like processing of the clouds is not very appealing to me though. The white of the clouds becomes a dirty white (or grey if you will). I like the reflection better. And I wouldn''t even mind a crop of this that chops off the clouds on the top - the reflection is what hogs all the attention anyway.', '2011-08-04 19:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493366, 964865, 59796, '<td valign="top">Interesting processing that indeed makes it look like hell! Wonderful, creamy water look as well. Don''t quite get the portrait orientation for this though - it feels like the river''s unnecessarily chopped off on the right and the extra sky on the top doesn''t add anything to the picture. Would''ve preferred a landscape orientation for sure.</td>', 'Interesting processing that indeed makes it look like hell! Wonderful, creamy water look as well. Don''t quite get the portrait orientation for this though - it feels like the river''s unnecessarily chopped off on the right and the extra sky on the top doesn''t add anything to the picture. Would''ve preferred a landscape orientation for sure.', '2011-08-04 19:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493372, 964529, 59796, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very difficult lighting scenario with harsh shadows, captured very well. Love the dirt flying up and the bull''s pose that indicates the chaos and struggle captured only momentarily in the shot. Love the intensity on the faces of on-lookers, although one guys appears to be enjoying it too much :) A lot going on in the pic that makes me want to study it for a bit. Nicely done.</td>', 'Looks like a very difficult lighting scenario with harsh shadows, captured very well. Love the dirt flying up and the bull''s pose that indicates the chaos and struggle captured only momentarily in the shot. Love the intensity on the faces of on-lookers, although one guys appears to be enjoying it too much :) A lot going on in the pic that makes me want to study it for a bit. Nicely done.', '2011-08-04 19:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493376, 962249, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice! Great lighting on the foreground. Although you''ve processed the picture well enough to make the yucca as the subject instead of the sunset/sunrise, it still competes for attention. Don''t mind it much, but my eye does wander between the two.</td>', 'Nice! Great lighting on the foreground. Although you''ve processed the picture well enough to make the yucca as the subject instead of the sunset/sunrise, it still competes for attention. Don''t mind it much, but my eye does wander between the two.', '2011-08-04 19:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493377, 964845, 59796, '<td valign="top">Moody! Although overprocessed, it does set the mood perfectly. I wish the orange tones on the banks were a little more subtle so as not to draw so much attention. Also, the two pipes sticking out at bottom-right are highly distractin.</td>', 'Moody! Although overprocessed, it does set the mood perfectly. I wish the orange tones on the banks were a little more subtle so as not to draw so much attention. Also, the two pipes sticking out at bottom-right are highly distractin.', '2011-08-04 19:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493383, 963286, 59796, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very difficult lighting scenario with harsh shadows, captured very well. Love the dirt flying up all over. I can almost hear the horse think "I can outwit this guy!" :) The green cast on the horse''s front leg seems a bit out of place because of it''s color. A lot going on in the pic that makes me want to study it for a bit. Nicely done.</td>', 'Looks like a very difficult lighting scenario with harsh shadows, captured very well. Love the dirt flying up all over. I can almost hear the horse think "I can outwit this guy!" :) The green cast on the horse''s front leg seems a bit out of place because of it''s color. A lot going on in the pic that makes me want to study it for a bit. Nicely done.', '2011-08-04 19:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493438, 961168, 94241, '<td valign="top">You have beautiful colors, and there''s a lot of gorgeous tones on the small-detail scale.  But I think on a larger-detail scale everything is kind of uniformly bright.  If there were some shadow gradients across, say the sky or the ground, I think that would boost this to the next level.</td>', 'You have beautiful colors, and there''s a lot of gorgeous tones on the small-detail scale.  But I think on a larger-detail scale everything is kind of uniformly bright.  If there were some shadow gradients across, say the sky or the ground, I think that would boost this to the next level.', '2011-08-04 21:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493439, 964840, 94241, '<td valign="top">The bendy crow''s nest is kinda cool, but the bendy horizon line bugs me a little.</td>', 'The bendy crow''s nest is kinda cool, but the bendy horizon line bugs me a little.', '2011-08-04 21:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6493440, 964644, 94241, '<td valign="top">Ah!  Those eyes!  It wants to eat my soul!<br/> <br/>I''m scared easily by babies.  This one, albeit technically an excellent shot, freaks me out.<br/> <br/>*ponders*  That''s probably worth an extra point.</td>', 'Ah!  Those eyes!  It wants to eat my soul! I''m scared easily by babies.  This one, albeit technically an excellent shot, freaks me out. *ponders*  That''s probably worth an extra point.', '2011-08-04 21:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
