(6493937, 964230, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something very comical about this image.  Perhaps that it is flipped, or the pov is horizontal instead of vertical, it looks like he''s fooling around instead of straining for the next hold.  The figure on the upper right helps a bit but I still can''t shake the comedy of this.</td>', 'There is something very comical about this image.  Perhaps that it is flipped, or the pov is horizontal instead of vertical, it looks like he''s fooling around instead of straining for the next hold.  The figure on the upper right helps a bit but I still can''t shake the comedy of this.', '2011-08-05 03:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
