(6493971, 964776, 28427, '<td valign="top">How one sets up his/her photograph is a personal choice.  Fact that 2 friends have been photographed is nice, but I believe this photograph would even have been better without the 2 girls: the surroundings there are simply beautiful and somehow the 2 girls are posing like tourists...<br/>Sorry, I don''t want to offend you, but this is the feeling I''m getting out of this: a superb photograph with a touch of tourism</td>', 'How one sets up his/her photograph is a personal choice.  Fact that 2 friends have been photographed is nice, but I believe this photograph would even have been better without the 2 girls: the surroundings there are simply beautiful and somehow the 2 girls are posing like tourists...Sorry, I don''t want to offend you, but this is the feeling I''m getting out of this: a superb photograph with a touch of tourism', '2011-08-05 03:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
