(6494148, 962862, 42256, '<td valign="top">Love the natural framing - nice composition! IMO it might have worked really well in B&amp;W, it would have really popped the castle and made the beauty of the textures really stand out.</td>', 'Love the natural framing - nice composition! IMO it might have worked really well in B&W, it would have really popped the castle and made the beauty of the textures really stand out.', '2011-08-05 10:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494152, 962875, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful simple shot  - love the long exposure shots like these. If the footsteps in the foreground were more highlighted it would have taken this shot to yet another level for me. Since it was advanced editing burning around that area might have helped.</td>', 'Beautiful simple shot  - love the long exposure shots like these. If the footsteps in the foreground were more highlighted it would have taken this shot to yet another level for me. Since it was advanced editing burning around that area might have helped.', '2011-08-05 10:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
