(6494167, 964796, 42256, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and what a beautiful landscape! Hope to see this in the top 10!</td>', 'Brilliant colors and what a beautiful landscape! Hope to see this in the top 10!', '2011-08-05 10:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494179, 963053, 42256, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful scene this is! As a photographer I wait for something like this to happen. Things falling in the right place and if I don''t have my DSLR with me at those perfect times I try to kick myself for not carrying it all the time.  Looking at the noise / sharpness / contrast it looks like you went through a similar story while taking this shot!</td>', 'What a beautiful scene this is! As a photographer I wait for something like this to happen. Things falling in the right place and if I don''t have my DSLR with me at those perfect times I try to kick myself for not carrying it all the time.  Looking at the noise / sharpness / contrast it looks like you went through a similar story while taking this shot!', '2011-08-05 10:36:22.000000', NULL, 1),
