(6494187, 964839, 42256, '<td valign="top">This is a beautifully composed scene and great place to be.  Processing wise imo this could use a little help. I would have cropped the picture from the bottom - to the edge of the building, river is not doing much in terms of reflection.  The door and gondola are in the similar color palette, processing it to make it match even closer would have really taken this shot to another level.</td>', 'This is a beautifully composed scene and great place to be.  Processing wise imo this could use a little help. I would have cropped the picture from the bottom - to the edge of the building, river is not doing much in terms of reflection.  The door and gondola are in the similar color palette, processing it to make it match even closer would have really taken this shot to another level.', '2011-08-05 10:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494193, 964755, 42256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clouds and a great long exposure.  Love how the colors of sky are reflecting on the foreground rocks and tying it all together!</td>', 'Beautiful clouds and a great long exposure.  Love how the colors of sky are reflecting on the foreground rocks and tying it all together!', '2011-08-05 10:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494194, 962862, 131284, '<td valign="top">Nice... a fellow local or were you just visiting? Being only ~14 miles away Bodiam Castle''s been on my "to-do" list to photo ever since I got a dslr (4 months ago) - but there''s a lot to photograph round here so haven''t had the time for this one yet =).<br/> <br/>Hope it does well, it''s a great shot of it.</td>', 'Nice... a fellow local or were you just visiting? Being only ~14 miles away Bodiam Castle''s been on my "to-do" list to photo ever since I got a dslr (4 months ago) - but there''s a lot to photograph round here so haven''t had the time for this one yet =). Hope it does well, it''s a great shot of it.', '2011-08-05 10:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
