(6494696, 964075, 16106, '<td valign="top">What an amazing macro. The subject is striking, and the execution is flawless.</td>', 'What an amazing macro. The subject is striking, and the execution is flawless.', '2011-08-05 20:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494701, 964930, 59796, '<td valign="top">Don''t quite get the title, but the picture is wonderful! Amazing distorted lines and patterns. A tad too dark maybe? Also, would''ve been cool if there were a focal point - like a bird flying across or a person walking across, outside the glass panes - for reference. As it is, it''s a nice abstract.</td>', 'Don''t quite get the title, but the picture is wonderful! Amazing distorted lines and patterns. A tad too dark maybe? Also, would''ve been cool if there were a focal point - like a bird flying across or a person walking across, outside the glass panes - for reference. As it is, it''s a nice abstract.', '2011-08-05 20:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494702, 963903, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and colors, but the lighting on her face gives her a bit of a scowl and some odd shadow lines that are unflattering. The post processing is good for the most part but the masking around her head is a bit sloppy, leaving a halo of brightness, showing the darkening of the background. I know those dodge lines don''t bother some, but for me I wonder if it would not have been better to either cut the dodge in all the way, or feather it out so the fall off was more gradual. As is i find it one of the most dominant elements int he image.</td>', 'Nice framing and colors, but the lighting on her face gives her a bit of a scowl and some odd shadow lines that are unflattering. The post processing is good for the most part but the masking around her head is a bit sloppy, leaving a halo of brightness, showing the darkening of the background. I know those dodge lines don''t bother some, but for me I wonder if it would not have been better to either cut the dodge in all the way, or feather it out so the fall off was more gradual. As is i find it one of the most dominant elements int he image.', '2011-08-05 20:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494705, 964867, 16106, '<td valign="top">My first take is ...huh? Why take this image? What are you trying to show or tell me? It seems it must make sense to you, but i just don''t get it. Also the crop is pretty tight and the focus is pretty soft (deeper DOF?). I do like the blue light on the left and the way it makes the right side contrast nicely</td>', 'My first take is ...huh? Why take this image? What are you trying to show or tell me? It seems it must make sense to you, but i just don''t get it. Also the crop is pretty tight and the focus is pretty soft (deeper DOF?). I do like the blue light on the left and the way it makes the right side contrast nicely', '2011-08-05 20:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494707, 964361, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot Tareq, it turned out really well, the shadows of the forelock really interact well with the vascularity of the head. I know I''m in the minority, but I still think a touch more room on the right is warranted to balance out the length of shoulder. Great job, ought to ribbon.<br/>PS comment only since I know the shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot Tareq, it turned out really well, the shadows of the forelock really interact well with the vascularity of the head. I know I''m in the minority, but I still think a touch more room on the right is warranted to balance out the length of shoulder. Great job, ought to ribbon.PS comment only since I know the shot.', '2011-08-05 20:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494710, 964710, 59796, '<td valign="top">Delightful shades of Orange. The dark cloud lines and silhouettes add a lot of interest. A bit too much of darkness in the pic though, I think. A slight crop from the right and bottom maybe?</td>', 'Delightful shades of Orange. The dark cloud lines and silhouettes add a lot of interest. A bit too much of darkness in the pic though, I think. A slight crop from the right and bottom maybe?', '2011-08-05 20:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494715, 963414, 59796, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool! The lighting is harsh, but then there''s that wonderful Rainbow to justify it :) The water looks a tad overexposed though.</td>', 'Pretty cool! The lighting is harsh, but then there''s that wonderful Rainbow to justify it :) The water looks a tad overexposed though.', '2011-08-05 20:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494718, 963623, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and shot well. The model''s looking a little too "Barbie"ish for my taste though - a bit too much make up or skin smoothening I think.</td>', 'Nice pose and shot well. The model''s looking a little too "Barbie"ish for my taste though - a bit too much make up or skin smoothening I think.', '2011-08-05 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494721, 962867, 59796, '<td valign="top">A very cool capture. Having seen <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59267" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">william88</a>''s hummer captures, DPCers expectations have gone up I think. I would''ve liked a bit more light on the wings - maybe a flash from under? And the vignetting is slightly distracting on this pic. But, I know how hard it is to capture hummers in flight, so, well done...</td>', 'A very cool capture. Having seen  william88''s hummer captures, DPCers expectations have gone up I think. I would''ve liked a bit more light on the wings - maybe a flash from under? And the vignetting is slightly distracting on this pic. But, I know how hard it is to capture hummers in flight, so, well done...', '2011-08-05 20:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494723, 964428, 59796, '<td valign="top">Sheesh! What I wouldn''t give to be living there. A very cool IR shot that does imply the title very well. Looks a teeny bit overprocessed, but then all IR shots do I think. Very nice.</td>', 'Sheesh! What I wouldn''t give to be living there. A very cool IR shot that does imply the title very well. Looks a teeny bit overprocessed, but then all IR shots do I think. Very nice.', '2011-08-05 20:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494726, 964329, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice, soft lighting and excellent color contrast between land/water/air. Love it. Wish the lighthouse were a bigger and more imposing subject. It doesn''t stand out much, but all lines lead to it.</td>', 'Nice, soft lighting and excellent color contrast between land/water/air. Love it. Wish the lighthouse were a bigger and more imposing subject. It doesn''t stand out much, but all lines lead to it.', '2011-08-05 21:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494727, 964271, 59796, '<td valign="top">Pleased to meet you? :)<br/>A cool capture and like the DOF as well. Would''ve loved to see the other eye clearly - otherwise it''s looking like a mutant :D Also, the two crossing lines in the background are highly distracting - maybe blur them out more?</td>', 'Pleased to meet you? :)A cool capture and like the DOF as well. Would''ve loved to see the other eye clearly - otherwise it''s looking like a mutant :D Also, the two crossing lines in the background are highly distracting - maybe blur them out more?', '2011-08-05 21:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494728, 964860, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice! Shooting against the light is pretty hard, and this is done nicely. The saturation feels a little artificial though - especially the rich green on the right foliage. Love the smooth rushing water.</td>', 'Nice! Shooting against the light is pretty hard, and this is done nicely. The saturation feels a little artificial though - especially the rich green on the right foliage. Love the smooth rushing water.', '2011-08-05 21:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
