(6494735, 963955, 59796, '<td valign="top">Sheesh! Glad I''m not in a staring contest - I wouldn''t stand a chance. My first impression''s a WOW! On closer inspection, the eyes don''t somehow carry much details - feels like a heavy crop. Good capture nevertheless..</td>', 'Sheesh! Glad I''m not in a staring contest - I wouldn''t stand a chance. My first impression''s a WOW! On closer inspection, the eyes don''t somehow carry much details - feels like a heavy crop. Good capture nevertheless..', '2011-08-05 21:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6494737, 964032, 59796, '<td valign="top">Love the Multnomah falls. Best of the shots of this I''ve seen so far in this free study. Glad you chose to keep some of the surroundings and not made it a narrow tall crop. Not too sure about the positioning of the bridge though - a bit too close to center I think.</td>', 'Love the Multnomah falls. Best of the shots of this I''ve seen so far in this free study. Glad you chose to keep some of the surroundings and not made it a narrow tall crop. Not too sure about the positioning of the bridge though - a bit too close to center I think.', '2011-08-05 21:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
