(6495230, 964407, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Wonderful journalistic image. The tones are straight out of a vintage photo book. A most interesting scene and even more interesting POV - where were you??? I really like the kites (if that''s what they are) in the sky and how they leave little trails.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: No<br/> <br/>Overall: Most compeling.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Wonderful journalistic image. The tones are straight out of a vintage photo book. A most interesting scene and even more interesting POV - where were you??? I really like the kites (if that''s what they are) in the sky and how they leave little trails. Critical stuff: No Overall: Most compeling.', '2011-08-06 10:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495236, 962389, 117037, '<td valign="top">Great pic, clearly told by the title 9.</td>', 'Great pic, clearly told by the title 9.', '2011-08-06 10:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495239, 964358, 117037, '<td valign="top">Nice concept great technique of slow shutter and layering with camera rotation(?) 9.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-08 12:13:03.</i></td>', 'Nice concept great technique of slow shutter and layering with camera rotation(?) 9.', '2011-08-06 10:16:53.000000', '2011-08-08 13:13:03.000000', 1),
(6495248, 964147, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Fabulous composition with a title that resonates perfectly.The tones are lovely as is the great sense of texture throughout the image. The man inside communicates the sense of a ghost unable (or unwilling) to let go...<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Nothing really<br/> <br/>Overall: Looks like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jagar</a> to me. That, of course, is a very good thing!</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Fabulous composition with a title that resonates perfectly.The tones are lovely as is the great sense of texture throughout the image. The man inside communicates the sense of a ghost unable (or unwilling) to let go... Critical stuff: Nothing really Overall: Looks like a  jagar to me. That, of course, is a very good thing!', '2011-08-06 10:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495252, 963392, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: What an atmosphere. I feel warm just looking at the image. The tones and sharpness in the lower half of the image are superbly presented. The composition too is masterful, affording the image with hug he depth.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: That little triangular gap in the clouds at the top of the image. It distracts a little and would easily be cloned.<br/> <br/>Overall: Very nicely made indeed.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: What an atmosphere. I feel warm just looking at the image. The tones and sharpness in the lower half of the image are superbly presented. The composition too is masterful, affording the image with hug he depth. Critical stuff: That little triangular gap in the clouds at the top of the image. It distracts a little and would easily be cloned. Overall: Very nicely made indeed.', '2011-08-06 10:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495253, 961102, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Wonderful subjects, composition, light and colour. This is just tremendous Johannah - I loved it when I saw it in your Flickr portfolio and I love it here. Makes me want to take a deep breath. Her dress against the green door and the French Bulldog pocking through the hatch is just marvellous. And chickens too!<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: Perhaps the right foot distorted by the lens and its proximity looks a bit odd for some audiences (but personally I think it adds to the quirkiness of the image).<br/> <br/>Overall: Just spectacularly accomplished. I hope this ribbons.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Wonderful subjects, composition, light and colour. This is just tremendous Johannah - I loved it when I saw it in your Flickr portfolio and I love it here. Makes me want to take a deep breath. Her dress against the green door and the French Bulldog pocking through the hatch is just marvellous. And chickens too! Critical stuff: Perhaps the right foot distorted by the lens and its proximity looks a bit odd for some audiences (but personally I think it adds to the quirkiness of the image). Overall: Just spectacularly accomplished. I hope this ribbons.', '2011-08-06 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495254, 964391, 101668, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve seen this before! Is this Margaret? The Yarra valley? Any case wonderful layers, lighting and composition. Love it</td>', 'I think I''ve seen this before! Is this Margaret? The Yarra valley? Any case wonderful layers, lighting and composition. Love it', '2011-08-06 10:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495256, 964242, 101668, '<td valign="top">Sweet sweet photography. Great one</td>', 'Sweet sweet photography. Great one', '2011-08-06 10:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495257, 963395, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: So easy to have gone with something more conventional with this scene - instead you give us this dark mysterious and slightly sensual take on the scene. Masterfully restrained and fully of smudgy goodness. I really like your use of negative space too.<br/> <br/>Critical Stuff: I wouldn''t dream of it.<br/> <br/>Overall: Looking forward to seeing who is responsible. Amazing stuff.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: So easy to have gone with something more conventional with this scene - instead you give us this dark mysterious and slightly sensual take on the scene. Masterfully restrained and fully of smudgy goodness. I really like your use of negative space too. Critical Stuff: I wouldn''t dream of it. Overall: Looking forward to seeing who is responsible. Amazing stuff.', '2011-08-06 10:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
