(6495360, 964636, 11769, '<td valign="top">Crowded and wonderful shot of the human condition</td>', 'Crowded and wonderful shot of the human condition', '2011-08-06 12:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495361, 964906, 11769, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2011-08-06 12:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495362, 964665, 11769, '<td valign="top">Great stuff.</td>', 'Great stuff.', '2011-08-06 12:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495363, 964903, 11769, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract.', '2011-08-06 12:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495365, 964682, 59796, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this shot is from a camera you found lying around after the original photographer has been devoured by the cat...<br/> <br/>Well then, the original photographer did a wonderful job of capturing the leopard crisply, although he must''ve been focusing on a stone in the ground when the leopard walked into frame.. May he rest in peace..<br/> <br/>And congrats - good find on the camera :)</td>', 'I''m assuming this shot is from a camera you found lying around after the original photographer has been devoured by the cat... Well then, the original photographer did a wonderful job of capturing the leopard crisply, although he must''ve been focusing on a stone in the ground when the leopard walked into frame.. May he rest in peace.. And congrats - good find on the camera :)', '2011-08-06 12:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495366, 964927, 11769, '<td valign="top">Yes. I think boredom has set in with these two.</td>', 'Yes. I think boredom has set in with these two.', '2011-08-06 12:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495367, 964147, 11769, '<td valign="top">That guy in the window is priceless.</td>', 'That guy in the window is priceless.', '2011-08-06 12:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495368, 964925, 3585, '<td valign="top">Clarity is a good repartition of light and shadows<br/>(Goethe I''m pretty sure)</td>', 'Clarity is a good repartition of light and shadows(Goethe I''m pretty sure)', '2011-08-06 12:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495369, 963304, 11769, '<td valign="top">They sure do. Wonderful.</td>', 'They sure do. Wonderful.', '2011-08-06 12:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495370, 960280, 3585, '<td valign="top">I hope "cruel world" are not the words that follow!</td>', 'I hope "cruel world" are not the words that follow!', '2011-08-06 12:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495371, 963484, 59796, '<td valign="top">I wonder who this could be.... :)<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=960662" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1417/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_960662.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1417/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_960662.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1417/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_960662.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>This picture''s darker and cleaner than the other one, but that one''s got a better reflection. Both have that distracting silhouette on the left that''s dragging away a little bit of attention from the couple (they probably would prefer that anyway :)<br/>Nice capture..</td>', 'I wonder who this could be.... :)  This picture''s darker and cleaner than the other one, but that one''s got a better reflection. Both have that distracting silhouette on the left that''s dragging away a little bit of attention from the couple (they probably would prefer that anyway :)Nice capture..', '2011-08-06 12:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495372, 964472, 11769, '<td valign="top">I wanna see!</td>', 'I wanna see!', '2011-08-06 12:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495373, 964705, 11769, '<td valign="top">That is a beautiful wall.</td>', 'That is a beautiful wall.', '2011-08-06 12:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495374, 964901, 11769, '<td valign="top">Timeless</td>', 'Timeless', '2011-08-06 12:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495375, 964959, 59796, '<td valign="top">A very cool capture. Having seen  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=59267" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">william88</a>''s hummer captures, DPCers expectations have gone up for these kind of shots I think. I would''ve liked a faster shutter to freeze the wings, and less noise in the background, and a bit more light on the underside of the hummer. But, I know how hard it is to capture hummers in flight, so, well done...</td>', 'A very cool capture. Having seen   william88''s hummer captures, DPCers expectations have gone up for these kind of shots I think. I would''ve liked a faster shutter to freeze the wings, and less noise in the background, and a bit more light on the underside of the hummer. But, I know how hard it is to capture hummers in flight, so, well done...', '2011-08-06 12:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495376, 962389, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love this</td>', 'Love this', '2011-08-06 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495377, 964255, 11769, '<td valign="top">I can fly!</td>', 'I can fly!', '2011-08-06 12:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495378, 963053, 11769, '<td valign="top">That''s'' a nice rainbow!</td>', 'That''s'' a nice rainbow!', '2011-08-06 12:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495379, 962875, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the blur and light.</td>', 'Love the blur and light.', '2011-08-06 12:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495380, 964585, 11769, '<td valign="top">This is a great candid. Everyone with a different expression.</td>', 'This is a great candid. Everyone with a different expression.', '2011-08-06 12:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495381, 964559, 11769, '<td valign="top">To stretch out is so relaxing</td>', 'To stretch out is so relaxing', '2011-08-06 12:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495382, 964971, 11769, '<td valign="top">Love the light.</td>', 'Love the light.', '2011-08-06 12:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495384, 964925, 11769, '<td valign="top">Wonderful stuff.</td>', 'Wonderful stuff.', '2011-08-06 12:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495385, 964328, 11769, '<td valign="top">The doggy is floating!</td>', 'The doggy is floating!', '2011-08-06 12:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495431, 964255, 69324, '<td valign="top">Not sure how well I like the exposure settings, but definitely an interesting composition.</td>', 'Not sure how well I like the exposure settings, but definitely an interesting composition.', '2011-08-06 13:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495439, 962787, 69324, '<td valign="top">That''s truly nice Tim.</td>', 'That''s truly nice Tim.', '2011-08-06 13:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495443, 961266, 69324, '<td valign="top">I expect you''ll get beat up some because the background is rather dark but that''s a nice in flight catch.</td>', 'I expect you''ll get beat up some because the background is rather dark but that''s a nice in flight catch.', '2011-08-06 13:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495445, 963847, 69324, '<td valign="top">Nice enough work that it made me personally hope he came out of the situation all right.</td>', 'Nice enough work that it made me personally hope he came out of the situation all right.', '2011-08-06 13:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495452, 963623, 118154, '<td valign="top">Not overkeen on the model but great shot.</td>', 'Not overkeen on the model but great shot.', '2011-08-06 13:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495453, 964172, 118154, '<td valign="top">It is a beauty.</td>', 'It is a beauty.', '2011-08-06 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495454, 964548, 59796, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful creature! Nice composition and wonderful lines all around. I wonder if it''s because of the size limit on the jpeg or because it''s a heavy crop, but seems like there''s should be more detail in the feathers.</td>', 'Such a beautiful creature! Nice composition and wonderful lines all around. I wonder if it''s because of the size limit on the jpeg or because it''s a heavy crop, but seems like there''s should be more detail in the feathers.', '2011-08-06 13:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495455, 964854, 118154, '<td valign="top">Wrinkly or what ?  Good candid shot.</td>', 'Wrinkly or what ?  Good candid shot.', '2011-08-06 13:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495456, 964575, 118154, '<td valign="top">Clean and bright , not much more one can say.</td>', 'Clean and bright , not much more one can say.', '2011-08-06 13:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495457, 964358, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nearly a great shot in my eye.</td>', 'Nearly a great shot in my eye.', '2011-08-06 13:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495459, 964633, 118154, '<td valign="top">Unusual tone you have here.</td>', 'Unusual tone you have here.', '2011-08-06 13:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495460, 964687, 118154, '<td valign="top">Very good capture.</td>', 'Very good capture.', '2011-08-06 13:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495461, 964610, 118154, '<td valign="top">Cute image.</td>', 'Cute image.', '2011-08-06 13:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495462, 964329, 118154, '<td valign="top">Is this Lovers Island ?  Nice shot.</td>', 'Is this Lovers Island ?  Nice shot.', '2011-08-06 13:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495463, 964398, 59796, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Not sure if it''s because of oily skin or makeup, but the light reflection on the skin is a little distracting. I would have darkened out the sofa and the wall and the carpet/rug seperation - they''re all noticeable and taking away from the subject - especially because they''re diagonal and intersecting the subject.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Not sure if it''s because of oily skin or makeup, but the light reflection on the skin is a little distracting. I would have darkened out the sofa and the wall and the carpet/rug seperation - they''re all noticeable and taking away from the subject - especially because they''re diagonal and intersecting the subject.', '2011-08-06 13:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495464, 963930, 118154, '<td valign="top">Works well for me,hope it goes well.</td>', 'Works well for me,hope it goes well.', '2011-08-06 13:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495465, 962787, 118154, '<td valign="top">Good stuff,I,m always looking for this type of shot.</td>', 'Good stuff,I,m always looking for this type of shot.', '2011-08-06 13:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495466, 964398, 118154, '<td valign="top">I find this fairly alluring.</td>', 'I find this fairly alluring.', '2011-08-06 13:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495468, 964766, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nice classic composition.</td>', 'Nice classic composition.', '2011-08-06 13:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495469, 964189, 118154, '<td valign="top">A bit to underexposed/dark n my screen.</td>', 'A bit to underexposed/dark n my screen.', '2011-08-06 13:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495470, 964558, 118154, '<td valign="top">Good conection with the viewer.</td>', 'Good conection with the viewer.', '2011-08-06 13:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495471, 963031, 118154, '<td valign="top">Everything in the right place,Lovely.</td>', 'Everything in the right place,Lovely.', '2011-08-06 13:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495472, 964621, 118154, '<td valign="top">Those eyes grab me every time.</td>', 'Those eyes grab me every time.', '2011-08-06 13:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495473, 964706, 118154, '<td valign="top">Great mono.</td>', 'Great mono.', '2011-08-06 13:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495474, 964139, 118154, '<td valign="top">Nice one 8.</td>', 'Nice one 8.', '2011-08-06 13:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495475, 964902, 59796, '<td valign="top">Phew! Nice capture! Not a fan of the spiders, but this one looks like an alien with so many eyes :) Would''ve loved a closer crop (fill-the-frame) - otherwise the composition''s quite odd and empty.</td>', 'Phew! Nice capture! Not a fan of the spiders, but this one looks like an alien with so many eyes :) Would''ve loved a closer crop (fill-the-frame) - otherwise the composition''s quite odd and empty.', '2011-08-06 13:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495476, 963639, 118154, '<td valign="top">Like the candid feel to this shot.</td>', 'Like the candid feel to this shot.', '2011-08-06 13:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495477, 964387, 118154, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot and model,pose looks a little odd.</td>', 'Lovely shot and model,pose looks a little odd.', '2011-08-06 13:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495478, 962253, 59796, '<td valign="top">Interesting and obvious subject, shot on such a nice day. Overall the picture feels too dark though - darker than it should be in such bright daylight. The black frame on top and bottom add to that feeling and don''t help the picture. Also, feels like the horizon is tilted (probably not, but feels like it)</td>', 'Interesting and obvious subject, shot on such a nice day. Overall the picture feels too dark though - darker than it should be in such bright daylight. The black frame on top and bottom add to that feeling and don''t help the picture. Also, feels like the horizon is tilted (probably not, but feels like it)', '2011-08-06 13:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495479, 964582, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! Seems like it''s angry as hell and is about to unleash a terrible set of laws on the people :) The sky sure feels that way. Love the B/W conversion and post-processing.</td>', 'Wow! Seems like it''s angry as hell and is about to unleash a terrible set of laws on the people :) The sky sure feels that way. Love the B/W conversion and post-processing.', '2011-08-06 13:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495480, 964756, 59796, '<td valign="top">Seems like a stock photo shot in good light. However, the HDR conversion? seems a little off - the leaves and the grass feel fake for some reason. Also, not having a strong subject makes it feel too generic.</td>', 'Seems like a stock photo shot in good light. However, the HDR conversion? seems a little off - the leaves and the grass feel fake for some reason. Also, not having a strong subject makes it feel too generic.', '2011-08-06 13:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495481, 964454, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line of wildflowers and interesting lines all around. Good soft lighting too. Would''ve loved it more if the wildflowers color stood out - like an orange or a yellow. In this case it''s a bit too subtle.</td>', 'Nice leading line of wildflowers and interesting lines all around. Good soft lighting too. Would''ve loved it more if the wildflowers color stood out - like an orange or a yellow. In this case it''s a bit too subtle.', '2011-08-06 14:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495482, 963639, 59796, '<td valign="top">Good concept and an apt title. The negative space on the left makes the pic feel unbalanced - I would crop it out. And the car wheel in the background is highly distracting - Maybe you can blur it out more in post-processing?</td>', 'Good concept and an apt title. The negative space on the left makes the pic feel unbalanced - I would crop it out. And the car wheel in the background is highly distracting - Maybe you can blur it out more in post-processing?', '2011-08-06 14:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495487, 963733, 59796, '<td valign="top">Such nice scenery! Love the lighting! I would crop out the bottom of the pic - the shoreline is distracting and leading away from the scene. Not allowed for free study, but I would also clone out the boat smack in the middle of the pic. Essentially, the subtle color lines of the boat on the right and the clouds and their reflections are what make this shot so wonderful. I would accentuate them and get rid of anything distracting. It would be poster worthy then.</td>', 'Such nice scenery! Love the lighting! I would crop out the bottom of the pic - the shoreline is distracting and leading away from the scene. Not allowed for free study, but I would also clone out the boat smack in the middle of the pic. Essentially, the subtle color lines of the boat on the right and the clouds and their reflections are what make this shot so wonderful. I would accentuate them and get rid of anything distracting. It would be poster worthy then.', '2011-08-06 14:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495488, 964925, 59796, '<td valign="top">Abstract, but I don''t quite get it :(<br/>Also, so many dust spots on your sensor - time for cleaning..</td>', 'Abstract, but I don''t quite get it :(Also, so many dust spots on your sensor - time for cleaning..', '2011-08-06 14:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495489, 964483, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this except for the title.</td>', 'I like everything about this except for the title.', '2011-08-06 14:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495490, 964201, 30049, '<td valign="top">Perfect timing - wonderful capture!</td>', 'Perfect timing - wonderful capture!', '2011-08-06 14:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495491, 963379, 59796, '<td valign="top">I went to Grand Tetons and missed out on this cabin. Still kick myself over it, even though it''s before I took up photography seriously.<br/>Wonderful soft morning light, and I love the rays on the mountains. Wish there were more clouds in the sky adding some texture and color. Great capture.</td>', 'I went to Grand Tetons and missed out on this cabin. Still kick myself over it, even though it''s before I took up photography seriously.Wonderful soft morning light, and I love the rays on the mountains. Wish there were more clouds in the sky adding some texture and color. Great capture.', '2011-08-06 14:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495493, 964255, 59796, '<td valign="top">Such graceful pose and nice high-key treatment. The train in the background feels unnecessary and distracting though. And the selective color on the train makes it even more distracting.</td>', 'Such graceful pose and nice high-key treatment. The train in the background feels unnecessary and distracting though. And the selective color on the train makes it even more distracting.', '2011-08-06 14:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495494, 963765, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lines and Beautiful colors on this one, although the prominence of the green is highly distracting from the rest of the scene.</td>', 'Wonderful lines and Beautiful colors on this one, although the prominence of the green is highly distracting from the rest of the scene.', '2011-08-06 14:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495495, 964982, 59796, '<td valign="top">Why so tiny? The capture is nice enough - a HDR of some nice cascade falls and the surrounding foliage. Would''ve loved to see it bigger than this.</td>', 'Why so tiny? The capture is nice enough - a HDR of some nice cascade falls and the surrounding foliage. Would''ve loved to see it bigger than this.', '2011-08-06 14:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495496, 964965, 59796, '<td valign="top">Hehe - an unusual entry in the free study. Interesting tilt composition too, and the scene is intriguing enough. Quite noisy though, and quite harsh lighting too.</td>', 'Hehe - an unusual entry in the free study. Interesting tilt composition too, and the scene is intriguing enough. Quite noisy though, and quite harsh lighting too.', '2011-08-06 14:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
