(6495498, 964511, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fabulous POV and framing with excellent DOF off into the distance. Love that the headless rider is motion blurred and the rest of the image not. Dry grass, winter blue sky looks decidedly southern hemisphere somewhere, SA?</td>', 'Fabulous POV and framing with excellent DOF off into the distance. Love that the headless rider is motion blurred and the rest of the image not. Dry grass, winter blue sky looks decidedly southern hemisphere somewhere, SA?', '2011-08-06 14:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495499, 963417, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! From the thumbnail I thought these were prairie dogs. Wonderful composition and such detail! Very nicely captured. The vignetting is slightly distracting though.</td>', 'Wow! From the thumbnail I thought these were prairie dogs. Wonderful composition and such detail! Very nicely captured. The vignetting is slightly distracting though.', '2011-08-06 14:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
