(6495505, 964981, 59796, '<td valign="top">What a Wonderful capture! I wish the subjects were a little more still during the extended exposure, but that''s about the only thing.. Also, the other campsite is grabbing some attention as well. But Wow! The subtle colors in the sky, the wonderful starts, the bluffs, the ocean, it''s magical!</td>', 'What a Wonderful capture! I wish the subjects were a little more still during the extended exposure, but that''s about the only thing.. Also, the other campsite is grabbing some attention as well. But Wow! The subtle colors in the sky, the wonderful starts, the bluffs, the ocean, it''s magical!', '2011-08-06 14:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495506, 963933, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wow look at that contrast. Superb B&amp;W scape. As crisp as the air no doubt. Would love to know the workflow!</td>', 'Wow look at that contrast. Superb B&W scape. As crisp as the air no doubt. Would love to know the workflow!', '2011-08-06 14:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
