(6495511, 964960, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice uniform background color, and nice concentric ripples. The detached crown is awesome and it''s reflection is pure delight. There are two dark straight lines (one of the left top, and the other on the top right) that are distracting (and against the ripples). Also, the picture feels like a massive crop - it''s missing detail on the crown itself.</td>', 'Nice uniform background color, and nice concentric ripples. The detached crown is awesome and it''s reflection is pure delight. There are two dark straight lines (one of the left top, and the other on the top right) that are distracting (and against the ripples). Also, the picture feels like a massive crop - it''s missing detail on the crown itself.', '2011-08-06 14:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495513, 964795, 76335, '<td valign="top">A beautiful and simple statement.</td>', 'A beautiful and simple statement.', '2011-08-06 14:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
