(6495690, 964309, 131284, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo, although I can''t work out what''s happening exactly, is the dart being thrown through a water balloon? Looks like a tree on a hill in the background to me.</td>', 'Really nice photo, although I can''t work out what''s happening exactly, is the dart being thrown through a water balloon? Looks like a tree on a hill in the background to me.', '2011-08-06 19:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495695, 964863, 111808, '<td valign="top">All hail the August King with golden eye and jungle-heart,<br/>That valiant spirit, he of piercing gaze,<br/>What shall we make of him, that wond''rous beast -<br/>Brought down to quaint repose in summer''s haze.<br/> <br/>This is a superb photograph, much enjoyed.</td>', 'All hail the August King with golden eye and jungle-heart,That valiant spirit, he of piercing gaze,What shall we make of him, that wond''rous beast -Brought down to quaint repose in summer''s haze. This is a superb photograph, much enjoyed.', '2011-08-06 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495696, 962868, 111808, '<td valign="top">Odd, eclectic, delightfully different. Very original and artfully executed, I do like this a lot.</td>', 'Odd, eclectic, delightfully different. Very original and artfully executed, I do like this a lot.', '2011-08-06 19:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495700, 964953, 111808, '<td valign="top">Dark and portentious, it is the reflections of the unsettled lenticular clouds that dominate this landscape and make this very effective. One can almost sense the waiting for whatever event is going to unfold. Nicely done!</td>', 'Dark and portentious, it is the reflections of the unsettled lenticular clouds that dominate this landscape and make this very effective. One can almost sense the waiting for whatever event is going to unfold. Nicely done!', '2011-08-06 19:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495708, 964796, 111808, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking seascape with the smoothness of the tides and the red coloured sky setting off the most magnificent three way contrast between the Heavens, the dark of the rocks and the blue of the water. Superb capture, there is so much beauty for the eye to drink in and linger over, even in the shapes.</td>', 'Breathtaking seascape with the smoothness of the tides and the red coloured sky setting off the most magnificent three way contrast between the Heavens, the dark of the rocks and the blue of the water. Superb capture, there is so much beauty for the eye to drink in and linger over, even in the shapes.', '2011-08-06 19:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495712, 964962, 111808, '<td valign="top">I love the shapes in this photograph - of the rocks and of the reflections which at first glance almost give one the impression of being in a cave looking out - that illusion is quite effective and powerful. Very tranquil, almost zen in its own way - you have a good eye to recognize this natural study and to capture it in such a way that it commands.</td>', 'I love the shapes in this photograph - of the rocks and of the reflections which at first glance almost give one the impression of being in a cave looking out - that illusion is quite effective and powerful. Very tranquil, almost zen in its own way - you have a good eye to recognize this natural study and to capture it in such a way that it commands.', '2011-08-06 20:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495716, 962799, 111808, '<td valign="top">Poor beautiful creature - Nature, like Man, is sometimes quite cruel.</td>', 'Poor beautiful creature - Nature, like Man, is sometimes quite cruel.', '2011-08-06 20:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495720, 964075, 108580, '<td valign="top">At first glance this looks like a once in a lifetime shot. However the lower beetle is clearly not holding onto the stem with it''s claws, holding its full body aloft, as any live beetle would do. It looks placed. The DF also has a broken segment on the top middle wing, a sign of a dried out dead specimen removed/replaced once too often from a specimen box. They have very good sight and it''s imo unlikely it would sit on a predator or land anywhere near anything that looks so different from the surrounding foliage.<br/>I''d say this is from the same author as this:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=959056" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_959056.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_959056.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1400/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_959056.jpg"/></a> <br/>and I''m now not so convinced that was natural either.</td>', 'At first glance this looks like a once in a lifetime shot. However the lower beetle is clearly not holding onto the stem with it''s claws, holding its full body aloft, as any live beetle would do. It looks placed. The DF also has a broken segment on the top middle wing, a sign of a dried out dead specimen removed/replaced once too often from a specimen box. They have very good sight and it''s imo unlikely it would sit on a predator or land anywhere near anything that looks so different from the surrounding foliage.I''d say this is from the same author as this: and I''m now not so convinced that was natural either.', '2011-08-06 20:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495721, 964278, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is a most powerful rockscape,craggy and towering and jagged reaching up to the Heavens in Bend and it is offset nicely by the serene blue of the night sky and the sprinkled starscape. Great landscape to linger over and back again.</td>', 'This is a most powerful rockscape,craggy and towering and jagged reaching up to the Heavens in Bend and it is offset nicely by the serene blue of the night sky and the sprinkled starscape. Great landscape to linger over and back again.', '2011-08-06 20:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495730, 962862, 108580, '<td valign="top">Super study, fab light on the castle with a foreboding sky. Horison is off clockwise.</td>', 'Super study, fab light on the castle with a foreboding sky. Horison is off clockwise.', '2011-08-06 20:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495733, 963977, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and balanced composition. PP seems a bit on the heavy saturated side but overall postcard perfect.</td>', 'Lovely image and balanced composition. PP seems a bit on the heavy saturated side but overall postcard perfect.', '2011-08-06 20:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495741, 964310, 108580, '<td valign="top">Looks suspisciously like a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> based on a previous appealing entry. Nice POV and statement on our cluttered world today.</td>', 'Looks suspisciously like a  Yo_Spiff based on a previous appealing entry. Nice POV and statement on our cluttered world today.', '2011-08-06 20:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495761, 962787, 111808, '<td valign="top">The juxtaposition of this is just perfect and hilarious!! Well done.</td>', 'The juxtaposition of this is just perfect and hilarious!! Well done.', '2011-08-06 20:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495767, 962787, 131284, '<td valign="top">Hah, nice.</td>', 'Hah, nice.', '2011-08-06 20:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495773, 964854, 111808, '<td valign="top">You have a gift of keen observation and the ability to create a superb portrait which honors your subject. The simple basic human condition displayed in this is rendered beautifully. The lines &amp; folds in the coat, repeating in the hands and again in the lined face &amp; subtly greyed curving hair make a compelling study. If only,"and miles to go before I sleep."</td>', 'You have a gift of keen observation and the ability to create a superb portrait which honors your subject. The simple basic human condition displayed in this is rendered beautifully. The lines & folds in the coat, repeating in the hands and again in the lined face & subtly greyed curving hair make a compelling study. If only,"and miles to go before I sleep."', '2011-08-06 20:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495777, 964151, 131284, '<td valign="top">I like this image although it''s a shame it''s slightly on the soft side. I gave it a 6, though it would have been a 7 with a little post-process sharpening or a little better focusing (assuming the softness isn''t a limitation of the equipment).</td>', 'I like this image although it''s a shame it''s slightly on the soft side. I gave it a 6, though it would have been a 7 with a little post-process sharpening or a little better focusing (assuming the softness isn''t a limitation of the equipment).', '2011-08-06 20:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6495780, 964982, 131284, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame the resolution of this photo is so low, it''s hard to score since it''s hard to see the scene. Was it taken on an old camera phone?</td>', 'It''s a shame the resolution of this photo is so low, it''s hard to score since it''s hard to see the scene. Was it taken on an old camera phone?', '2011-08-06 20:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
