(6496377, 964925, 54645, '<td valign="top">Ha! A colonoscopy gone bad, sometimes they get lost.  8</td>', 'Ha! A colonoscopy gone bad, sometimes they get lost.  8', '2011-08-07 11:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496378, 964775, 59796, '<td valign="top">Are you sure this is not a studio portrait? :)<br/>Very nice capture and processing. Love the variety of textures and patterns on display as well as the curves.</td>', 'Are you sure this is not a studio portrait? :)Very nice capture and processing. Love the variety of textures and patterns on display as well as the curves.', '2011-08-07 11:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496380, 964900, 54778, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught a great moment. The smoke/sparks near the man''s face and the gun shot are terrific. In such a action packed moment it is much harder to get the perfect composition and I''m assuming this is an uncropped frame but if it weren''t then the crop should have less of the torso, more of the elbow and more of the hat. There are also some editing issues that the whites aren''t completely white and the blacks aren''t completely black.</td>', 'You''ve caught a great moment. The smoke/sparks near the man''s face and the gun shot are terrific. In such a action packed moment it is much harder to get the perfect composition and I''m assuming this is an uncropped frame but if it weren''t then the crop should have less of the torso, more of the elbow and more of the hat. There are also some editing issues that the whites aren''t completely white and the blacks aren''t completely black.', '2011-08-07 11:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496383, 964878, 54778, '<td valign="top">This croc looks appropriately snarky and alert. I like your edit.</td>', 'This croc looks appropriately snarky and alert. I like your edit.', '2011-08-07 11:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496384, 961168, 59796, '<td valign="top">Too bad DPC only allows 800px - this would look gorgeous full screen! So many layers and textures... The green in the foreground is a tad overpowering the subtle tones in the rest of the pic I think.</td>', 'Too bad DPC only allows 800px - this would look gorgeous full screen! So many layers and textures... The green in the foreground is a tad overpowering the subtle tones in the rest of the pic I think.', '2011-08-07 11:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496387, 964898, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The fog adds mystery and charm. Would love to be living in that house...</td>', 'Beautiful! The fog adds mystery and charm. Would love to be living in that house...', '2011-08-07 11:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496394, 964425, 59796, '<td valign="top">Never seen one come this close to a full circle before - awesome! I see quite a few dust bunnies though - time to clean the sensor? :)</td>', 'Never seen one come this close to a full circle before - awesome! I see quite a few dust bunnies though - time to clean the sensor? :)', '2011-08-07 11:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496397, 964654, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very subtle palettes in the flame and the background to complement the glowing edge of the burn. Nice! I would''ve cloned out the distracting white line on the left-middle.</td>', 'Very subtle palettes in the flame and the background to complement the glowing edge of the burn. Nice! I would''ve cloned out the distracting white line on the left-middle.', '2011-08-07 11:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496403, 964706, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The contrast between the serene setting and the brick buildings couldn''t be greater. Random irregular patterns of the rocks, meet structured man-made brick patterns. Wonderful B/W conversion as well.</td>', 'Beautiful! The contrast between the serene setting and the brick buildings couldn''t be greater. Random irregular patterns of the rocks, meet structured man-made brick patterns. Wonderful B/W conversion as well.', '2011-08-07 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496406, 964895, 59796, '<td valign="top">Hope you weren''t around when all hell broke loose :) Amazing texture on the clouds.</td>', 'Hope you weren''t around when all hell broke loose :) Amazing texture on the clouds.', '2011-08-07 11:54:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496411, 964309, 59796, '<td valign="top">Ha! Awesome capture!<br/>One must''ve seen such balloon explosion shots before to make out that this is one I think, since the tell-tale sign of contracting balloon rubber is missing.<br/>Leaving that hand in the pic is a nice touch...</td>', 'Ha! Awesome capture!One must''ve seen such balloon explosion shots before to make out that this is one I think, since the tell-tale sign of contracting balloon rubber is missing.Leaving that hand in the pic is a nice touch...', '2011-08-07 11:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496414, 962799, 59796, '<td valign="top">Ouch! I feel for the eagle. :( A nice capture that immediately evokes sympathy. May have needed a bit more dof or something - I''m missing seeing more details on the feathers.</td>', 'Ouch! I feel for the eagle. :( A nice capture that immediately evokes sympathy. May have needed a bit more dof or something - I''m missing seeing more details on the feathers.', '2011-08-07 11:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496417, 964800, 54645, '<td valign="top">yeah, if only I were this cool</td>', 'yeah, if only I were this cool', '2011-08-07 11:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496418, 964479, 59796, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to find him :) A tiny sliver of a man against nature''s ferocious display of power. The whole mood of the picture is dark and sinister - almost like an impending doom. Hope the surfer made it out okay :) Nice.</td>', 'Took me a moment to find him :) A tiny sliver of a man against nature''s ferocious display of power. The whole mood of the picture is dark and sinister - almost like an impending doom. Hope the surfer made it out okay :) Nice.', '2011-08-07 11:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496422, 963967, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love the pastel palettes and the distant mountains and the smoothened out water. Such peace and quiet...</td>', 'Wow! Love the pastel palettes and the distant mountains and the smoothened out water. Such peace and quiet...', '2011-08-07 12:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496423, 960797, 59796, '<td valign="top">The truck itself is fabulous and wonderfully contrasted against the foliage. The road right beside it is a wonderful setting - so near, yet so far for the truck. Nice enough HDR conversion - I would''ve cropped out the sky completely though - looks very unreal and distracting.</td>', 'The truck itself is fabulous and wonderfully contrasted against the foliage. The road right beside it is a wonderful setting - so near, yet so far for the truck. Nice enough HDR conversion - I would''ve cropped out the sky completely though - looks very unreal and distracting.', '2011-08-07 12:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
