(6496483, 964673, 59796, '<td valign="top">Must be one happy cow to have an entire meadow for self :) Love the blue/green combo - looks like a windows background. Good eye. And a witty title as well :P</td>', 'Must be one happy cow to have an entire meadow for self :) Love the blue/green combo - looks like a windows background. Good eye. And a witty title as well :P', '2011-08-07 12:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
