(6496559, 961349, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and wonderful soft natural light. Feels a bit too abruptly cut off at the neckline and hands. A bit more breathing space would make this pic even better I think.</td>', 'Nice pose and wonderful soft natural light. Feels a bit too abruptly cut off at the neckline and hands. A bit more breathing space would make this pic even better I think.', '2011-08-07 14:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
