(6496723, 964906, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the mood of discovering something you really want to explore ... sign or no sign.  Who wouldn''t want to see if they can find the end of the rainbow?<br/> <br/>Nit:  I''d clone out that one little dark cloud on the left.  OK, maybe the medium ones just above it, too ;-)  My eye just wants to follow the path and those rather well-formed clouds keep drawing it away.  But then I suppose in real life I''d be keeping on eye on them in case they were about to rain upon me!</td>', 'Love the composition and the mood of discovering something you really want to explore ... sign or no sign.  Who wouldn''t want to see if they can find the end of the rainbow? Nit:  I''d clone out that one little dark cloud on the left.  OK, maybe the medium ones just above it, too ;-)  My eye just wants to follow the path and those rather well-formed clouds keep drawing it away.  But then I suppose in real life I''d be keeping on eye on them in case they were about to rain upon me!', '2011-08-07 17:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496725, 964147, 65234, '<td valign="top">The fellow in the window looks sadly wistful.  So many stories could be told here.</td>', 'The fellow in the window looks sadly wistful.  So many stories could be told here.', '2011-08-07 17:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
