(6496730, 963414, 108069, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful shot. So vivd and bright, and a rainbow for good measure. Crisp and clean. Well done.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful shot. So vivd and bright, and a rainbow for good measure. Crisp and clean. Well done.', '2011-08-07 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
