(6496824, 964622, 18367, '<td valign="top">... and to those who would argue that titles do nothing for a photograph, then they are absolutely wrong.  This is a very nice image, but the title had me in stitches for the longest time.  I even shared this image with a friend in Australia and we both had a very good chuckle.  The very best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', '... and to those who would argue that titles do nothing for a photograph, then they are absolutely wrong.  This is a very nice image, but the title had me in stitches for the longest time.  I even shared this image with a friend in Australia and we both had a very good chuckle.  The very best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2011-08-07 18:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496825, 964457, 109227, '<td valign="top">This looks like a beautiful place and the natural frame here is very nice.  IMO, it looks a little over exposed on the water and under in other spots; it also needs better focus and little more contrast.  Just suggestions. (voted earlier)</td>', 'This looks like a beautiful place and the natural frame here is very nice.  IMO, it looks a little over exposed on the water and under in other spots; it also needs better focus and little more contrast.  Just suggestions. (voted earlier)', '2011-08-07 18:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
