(6496845, 964147, 109227, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this image.  It looks a little set-up but I can''t tell.  I think it would be better if the man on the bach were looking down a little, as is it looks like he is posed and looking at nothing.  Still a very nice image (voted earlier).</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this image.  It looks a little set-up but I can''t tell.  I think it would be better if the man on the bach were looking down a little, as is it looks like he is posed and looking at nothing.  Still a very nice image (voted earlier).', '2011-08-07 18:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
