(6496898, 964955, 54778, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty sky and the colours are great though it''s a slightly standard shot (would have probably cropped the trees in the foreground). The dark hills look interesting though and the light falling on them catches my interest.</td>', 'It''s a pretty sky and the colours are great though it''s a slightly standard shot (would have probably cropped the trees in the foreground). The dark hills look interesting though and the light falling on them catches my interest.', '2011-08-07 20:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496902, 964291, 82064, '<td valign="top">Priceless! I lost my parents last year, 12 weeks apart. I wish I had a picture like this!</td>', 'Priceless! I lost my parents last year, 12 weeks apart. I wish I had a picture like this!', '2011-08-07 20:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496904, 964916, 54778, '<td valign="top">Your crop does emphasis the long walk but I think your crop makes the image look squashed. I see amazing details but I feel like they''re too far away for further appreciation. This image also has potential for a dramatic edit. I apologize in advance but this is what I would have done with this image <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=965333" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54778/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_965333.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54778/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_965333.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54778/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_965333.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Your crop does emphasis the long walk but I think your crop makes the image look squashed. I see amazing details but I feel like they''re too far away for further appreciation. This image also has potential for a dramatic edit. I apologize in advance but this is what I would have done with this image ', '2011-08-07 20:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496912, 964482, 54645, '<td valign="top">a bit spooky, lovely image</td>', 'a bit spooky, lovely image', '2011-08-07 20:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
