(6496919, 964930, 54645, '<td valign="top">What a wild journey a robust discussion will produce. 9</td>', 'What a wild journey a robust discussion will produce. 9', '2011-08-07 20:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496921, 962389, 54645, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, warm, lighting effect. Face is emotive and priceless. 8</td>', 'Gorgeous, warm, lighting effect. Face is emotive and priceless. 8', '2011-08-07 20:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496923, 963414, 54778, '<td valign="top">The top half is perfect but the lower half has both the flaw and the best part. Wish the waterfall didn''t end in the overblown highlights but the rainbow really adds to the image so cropping wouldn''t have been a good decision.</td>', 'The top half is perfect but the lower half has both the flaw and the best part. Wish the waterfall didn''t end in the overblown highlights but the rainbow really adds to the image so cropping wouldn''t have been a good decision.', '2011-08-07 20:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496924, 964469, 54645, '<td valign="top"><strike>Handsome</strike> Beautiful little <strike>guy</strike> girl, lovely BW and lighting effect. ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-08 00:10:58.</i></td>', 'Handsome Beautiful little guy girl, lovely BW and lighting effect. ;)', '2011-08-07 20:29:11.000000', '2011-08-08 01:10:58.000000', 1),
(6496929, 963765, 54778, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good shot. Slightly standard but well done though I admit I had a ''is that radioactive algae??!!'' moment. If it had been a darker green then perhaps it would have looked a little more natural.</td>', 'I think this is a good shot. Slightly standard but well done though I admit I had a ''is that radioactive algae??!!'' moment. If it had been a darker green then perhaps it would have looked a little more natural.', '2011-08-07 20:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496930, 963977, 54645, '<td valign="top">I never get tired of this scene. The distal hills are spot on, beautifully rendered color, texture, and tones. IMO, the foreground and bridge, and likely the boat, are not realistic in color rendition when compared to the background. Other than that, another wonder capture of this vista, due largely in part to the hills and seagull.</td>', 'I never get tired of this scene. The distal hills are spot on, beautifully rendered color, texture, and tones. IMO, the foreground and bridge, and likely the boat, are not realistic in color rendition when compared to the background. Other than that, another wonder capture of this vista, due largely in part to the hills and seagull.', '2011-08-07 20:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496934, 964704, 54778, '<td valign="top">You''ve caught the flowing water nicely although I would have preferred you chose a different perspective and either got all the statues by stepping back or just focused on one. Right now they''re all chopped up and we can''t see any one completely. The impact would have been more I think.</td>', 'You''ve caught the flowing water nicely although I would have preferred you chose a different perspective and either got all the statues by stepping back or just focused on one. Right now they''re all chopped up and we can''t see any one completely. The impact would have been more I think.', '2011-08-07 20:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496935, 963360, 54778, '<td valign="top">Interesting character study although I don''t think you needed to blur out the background because it doesn''t seem to be very distracting in the first place. It''s now that you''ve made the effort to disguise it that my eyes go straight towards it. I also believe this picture has great potential for b/w or sepia.</td>', 'Interesting character study although I don''t think you needed to blur out the background because it doesn''t seem to be very distracting in the first place. It''s now that you''ve made the effort to disguise it that my eyes go straight towards it. I also believe this picture has great potential for b/w or sepia.', '2011-08-07 20:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496936, 963905, 54778, '<td valign="top">The headless lady is made of win! She makes the picture.</td>', 'The headless lady is made of win! She makes the picture.', '2011-08-07 20:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496939, 964307, 54778, '<td valign="top">At first glance I thought the picture was completely out of focus but then saw the water in the background was sharper. I think you would have gained more if you had gotten the focus completely on the surfer or had a wider portion of the sea in the picture. Just the silhouette of the surfer might have also made things interesting.</td>', 'At first glance I thought the picture was completely out of focus but then saw the water in the background was sharper. I think you would have gained more if you had gotten the focus completely on the surfer or had a wider portion of the sea in the picture. Just the silhouette of the surfer might have also made things interesting.', '2011-08-07 20:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496941, 964898, 54778, '<td valign="top">I admit I am besotted with the location. What wouldn''t I do to get that house on the hill.</td>', 'I admit I am besotted with the location. What wouldn''t I do to get that house on the hill.', '2011-08-07 20:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496944, 964332, 54778, '<td valign="top">You have the perfect location, the perfect composition. I just wish it were brighter. There are details in there that I wish to see properly but I can''t just because of the lack of light.</td>', 'You have the perfect location, the perfect composition. I just wish it were brighter. There are details in there that I wish to see properly but I can''t just because of the lack of light.', '2011-08-07 20:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496975, 964814, 73056, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2011-08-07 21:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496978, 964361, 73056, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous horse. Well done.</td>', 'Gorgeous horse. Well done.', '2011-08-07 21:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496983, 964189, 73056, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture.</td>', 'Lovely capture.', '2011-08-07 21:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6496984, 963031, 73056, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2011-08-07 21:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
