(6497044, 964343, 83313, '<td valign="top">The 5th Element is one of my favorite movies. Anytime it comes on TV, I end up stopping what I am doing and watching it. Such a crazy universe! I really ought to attend a comic con sometime.</td>', 'The 5th Element is one of my favorite movies. Anytime it comes on TV, I end up stopping what I am doing and watching it. Such a crazy universe! I really ought to attend a comic con sometime.', '2011-08-07 22:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
