(6498051, 963304, 135629, '<td valign="top">Just one comment was removed. It had nothing to do with photography :) <br/>I submitted this photo because I thought it had nice B&amp;W tones, selective desat seems to be a tough sell unless done just right as I am learning here. But I am here to learn, so each challenge has been interresting. I enjoy and take to heart all the comments about what can be done better etc... to make better photographs. I am not trying to offend anyone with my photographs, so didn''t appreciate the non photography related politically motivated commentary. The five 1''s make statements along the same lines, but as with anything to each their own :) <br/> <br/>Thanks for your concern, and votes (whatever the score) have a great week and good luck in any challenges everyone is in.<br/> <br/>Nick</td>', 'Just one comment was removed. It had nothing to do with photography :) I submitted this photo because I thought it had nice B&W tones, selective desat seems to be a tough sell unless done just right as I am learning here. But I am here to learn, so each challenge has been interresting. I enjoy and take to heart all the comments about what can be done better etc... to make better photographs. I am not trying to offend anyone with my photographs, so didn''t appreciate the non photography related politically motivated commentary. The five 1''s make statements along the same lines, but as with anything to each their own :)  Thanks for your concern, and votes (whatever the score) have a great week and good luck in any challenges everyone is in. Nick', '2011-08-08 13:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
