(6498362, 964529, 124255, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the kind comments, although I would have loved to place in the top three  when I voted I knew with all the great shots this month it would be hard for any picture to place.  This site has made me, while just learning Photoshop, up my game with every image I shoot.  Im an old large format film guy that now has to admit- this new medium (new to me anyway) is a blast. Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks for all the kind comments, although I would have loved to place in the top three  when I voted I knew with all the great shots this month it would be hard for any picture to place.  This site has made me, while just learning Photoshop, up my game with every image I shoot.  Im an old large format film guy that now has to admit- this new medium (new to me anyway) is a blast. Thanks again.', '2011-08-08 17:02:48.000000', NULL, 0),
