liked it. And was just wondering how you been?  Thanks Tareq    I can do better! I will send you a print of it. Email me your address and I will order a print through DPC prints as soon as I order mine.', '2011-08-09 12:54:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6499347, 964361, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sherpet:</b></div><hr/><i> I struggle every single day but saw this photo a few days ago and was drawn to it immediately...TODAY I HAD TO TAKE A CLOSER LOOK and so glad I did I LOVE IT It is my favorite ANIMAL photo here at DPC for this year by far, Actually my Favorite ANIMAL PHOTO EVER.... THANK YOU for bringing some joy to my life. From shez </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That''s what all this should be about.  Making a positive difference in somebody''s life and you did it, Tareq!  Congratulations!</td>', 'Originally posted by sherpet: I struggle every single day but saw this photo a few days ago and was drawn to it immediately...TODAY I HAD TO TAKE A CLOSER LOOK and so glad I did I LOVE IT It is my favorite ANIMAL photo here at DPC for this year by far, Actually my Favorite ANIMAL PHOTO EVER.... THANK YOU for bringing some joy to my life. From shez   That''s what all this should be about.  Making a positive difference in somebody''s life and you did it, Tareq!  Congratulations!', '2011-08-09 14:25:48.000000', NULL, 0),
