(6502288, 964840, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great back story - and congrats on the almost 6/"<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=1021169" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tiny violin</a>" score, too!  Really a unique and enjoyable photograph.  Gotta watch for those French guys - just check out that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">jagar</a> fellow, for instance... :)</td>', 'Great back story - and congrats on the almost 6/"tiny violin" score, too!  Really a unique and enjoyable photograph.  Gotta watch for those French guys - just check out that  jagar fellow, for instance... :)', '2011-08-12 02:10:58.000000', NULL, 0),
