(6506789, 964310, 123348, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> This, to me, is magically musical.  I can literally hear music.  These guys have been neighbors for years and have formed a little band.  They play when they think no one can hear. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I meant to write earlier and just wanted to say thank you for your comment. I love your interpretation and wished I could change the title now as I like your idea much better! Thanks again...</td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: This, to me, is magically musical.  I can literally hear music.  These guys have been neighbors for years and have formed a little band.  They play when they think no one can hear.  I meant to write earlier and just wanted to say thank you for your comment. I love your interpretation and wished I could change the title now as I like your idea much better! Thanks again...', '2011-08-17 03:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
